{"parentUuid":"edbdd54b-d46f-403c-9ba0-32cbb000b63f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdZP1pHiJ8jCpXn5rYhAx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Workflow `wv6ffuftd` running — 8 parallel readers (each open PR, local work, roadmap, branches, issues, GraphMark link) → synthesized briefing. Meanwhile, the raw snapshot:\n\n**Repo:** `~/Documents/Coding/entire-brain`, on `feat/init-agents`, uncommitted.\n\n**Open PRs (3):**\n- **#75** (draft, 07-18) — brief retrieval + eval-pipeline hardening\n- **#74** (07-17) — git-meta-backed local fact store + `facts sync` ← the one I built\n- **#73** (07-17) — P0.M5 install docs + announcement\n\n**Main moved:** `Rename brain-bench to GraphMark` (newest) on top of #72 *Adopt Entire Graph across Brain*.\n\n**Merged since:** #72 graph adoption · #71 Phase-0B temporal-memory causal harness · #69 pending fact reviews in recall/brief · #68 fact vitality receipts · #67 adaptive project-memory retrieval · #66 temporal-memory ablation bench · #65 factsync camelCase fix · #64 P1 M2–M3 (merge engine + fact-sync runner + remote MCP).\n\n**Local unlanded:** commit `d0ba1e06` \"cli: init-agents\" + untracked `.claude/skills/`, `.codex/skills/`, `.cursor/`, `.gemini/`, `.mcp.json`, `.entire/{brain,graph}-agent.md` — an agent-guide installer, no PR yet.\n\nFull briefing (milestone status, per-PR blockers, parked codex/* branches, ranked next actions) lands when the workflow reports."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4280,"cache_read_input_tokens":458933,"output_tokens":654,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4280,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":654,"cache_read_input_tokens":458933,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4