{"parentUuid":"450d0af9-17ee-4e47-955d-cf4b23080deb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cde3SB2167xJMStCzUtby","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1385,"cache_read_input_tokens":495459,"output_tokens":1361,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1385},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1361,"cache_read_input_tokens":495459,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1385,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1385,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cde3S47miGnXEX9VGqfSZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"09c051c7-3d0e-45be-8e38-32e32f8eddaf","timestamp":"2026-08-02T14:00:34.576Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"08c113b1-6073-41d6-9c88-fa9632538501","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"09c051c7-3d0e-45be-8e38-32e32f8eddaf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cde3SB2167xJMStCzUtby","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — **5 open brain-stack PRs across 3 repos, all mine, all untouched since mid-July.** Plus this answers the gap from the last briefing.\n\n## The brain stack (paired halves, both open)\n| repo | PR | what | state |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **entireio/entire-brain** | **#74** | local git-meta fact store + `facts sync` (**client half**) | CI red (windows flock, gofmt) · 07-17 |\n| **entirehq/entire-api** | **#242** | P1 Shared/Hosted Brain — **server store** + fact-sync + remote MCP + tenancy | open, 0 review · 07-17 |\n| **entirehq/git-meta-service** | **#1** | value-CAS engine + gitclient retry + build-tag auth (**the engine brain vendored**) | open, audited+CI added · 07-17 |\n| entireio/entire-brain | #73 | P0.M5 install docs | green, mergeable · 07-17 |\n| entireio/entire-brain | #75 | brief retrieval + eval hardening (ashtom) | draft, 552 files, 11 conflicts |\n\n**This closes the unknown from the last briefing:** P1 **M1.2 server store** — the briefing said \"not in this repo, status unknown\" → it's **entire-api #242, open and unmerged.** So the P1 hosted-brain client (#64, merged in brain) and its server counterpart (#242, open in api) are split across the merge line. The client half is live on main; the server half never landed.\n\n**Dependency chain:** git-meta-service #1 → brain #74 (vendors the engine) → api #242 (hosted counterpart). Nothing merges cleanly out of order.\n\n## Also open (adjacent, not brain)\n- **entirehq/graphmark: 6** (#53–58) — graph/eg benchmark work, #58 opened today\n- entirehq/entire-api #333 — checkpoint-analysis Fireworks/DeepSeek swap (yours, ready, unmerged)\n- entireio/cli: 30 open (5 yours: #1880, #1826, #1778, #1777, #1752)\n\nNote: entiredb #2269 and the entire.io hits are false positives (matched \"meta\"/\"search\"), no brain work there.\n\n**The pattern:** every brain-stack PR is authored by you, has zero reviews, and has sat ~2 weeks. Nothing is waiting on another person.\n\nWant me to fix #74's CI (3 mechanical breaks, push-only) and pull the review state on #242 so the P1 pair is landable together?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1385,"cache_read_input_tokens":495459,"output_tokens":1361,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1385},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1361,"cache_read_input_tokens":495459,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1385,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1385,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cde3S47miGnXEX9VGqfSZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"d9447590-75e8-4d2f-abc1-1a6ce1dc2b48","timestamp":"2026-08-02T14:00:46.343Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"08c113b1-6073-41d6-9c88-fa9632538501","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
