{"parentUuid":"d9223a70-27d7-4111-93d3-51a97fa209ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdeAyhv45pW6RiTC3D8Co","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Independently verified — everything green. Recording state, then the summary:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_read_input_tokens":545213,"output_tokens":1752,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1802},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1752,"cache_read_input_tokens":545213,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1802,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdeAydRgNRCXA3TkwUsDL","type":"assistant","uuid":"f85c6921-82b5-45b8-8fc5-8a66ba6e2f6f","timestamp":"2026-08-02T15:39:26.665Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"08c113b1-6073-41d6-9c88-fa9632538501","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-75","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"f85c6921-82b5-45b8-8fc5-8a66ba6e2f6f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdeAyhv45pW6RiTC3D8Co","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012KsSAiAXK2jw55jAWoNCGa","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/p0-p1-completion-worktrees.md","content":"---\nname: p0-p1-completion-worktrees\ndescription: P0+P1 completion work for entire-brain #75 and entire-api #242 is BUILT and green in local worktrees, NOT pushed\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\n2026-08-02: built everything remaining for **P0 and P1** into two isolated worktrees. **All green, nothing pushed** (pushing to #75 needs care — it is ashtom's branch).\n\n**Worktrees:** `/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-75` (branch `p0p1/brain-75`, 6 commits atop PR #75 head 923b8a91) and `/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/api-242` (branch `p0p1/api-242`, 2 commits atop PR #242 head df65014a).\n\n**Key structural finding:** PR #75's branch was **84 behind main and missing main's entire P1 layer** (`internal/{brainwire,factsync,hostedbrain,factmerge}` from merged #59/#60/#64). Any P1 work had to be preceded by merging main in (11 conflicts: 9 product, 2 benchmark-python). Also **M1.3/M1.4 had no written spec** — one sentence at `docs/brain_wire_contract.md:113`; the rules were derived from the 4 hazards it names (Go HTML escaping, struct field order, omitempty, RFC3339Nano).\n\n**brain-75 commits:** `723eec23` merge main → `666c201b`/`2e4e160e`/`3bd2302d` fold PR #74 factgitmeta → `47bd6932` **fix #74's CI breaks** (flock split into `lock_unix.go`/`lock_windows.go` via `windows.LockFileEx`; gofmt) → `6418f74f` **M1.3** `internal/brainwire/canonical.go` (`CanonicalMarshal`/`Canonicalize`/`CanonicalUnmarshal`) → `a3bfc2ea` **M1.4** `signing.go` (ed25519, versioned `Signature` envelope, `ReferencedDigests` so the sig commits to every blob digest) → `ac96f01e` **#64 deferrals** (`internal/factsync/httpproposals.go` list/get/apply/resolve + `hostedbrain` client `ListProposals`/`GetProposal`/`ApplyProposal` + `entire-brain facts proposals {list,show,apply,reject}`) → `5ce71176` **P0** (folded #73 docs into main's README-centric layout, reconciled `ga-readiness.md` gates 9+10 ⏳→✅).\n\n**api-242 commits:** `ce0fc79c` merge origin/main → `eb522950` server side (`internal/brainbuild/proposals.go` + `proposal_index{,_pg}.go`, `internal/httpapi/brain_proposals.go`, `internal/brainstore/validate.go` manifest/blob-digest integrity on ingest, migration `20260802142559_brain_fact_proposals.sql` via the goose UTC convention).\n\n**Verified by me (not just agents):** brain — `go build`, `GOOS=windows go build`, `go vet ./...`, `gofmt -l` empty, `go test ./...` all 9 packages ok, brainwire `-race` ok. api — build/vet clean, brainbuild+brainstore+brainquery+httpapi tests ok; the 5 `gofmt -l` offenders are **pre-existing on main**, none ours.\n\n**Flagged for human review (from the merge):** (1) `benchmarks/agent-brain/run.py` adherence semantics — took main's *exclude* adherence-invalid runs over the branch's *retain*; methodology call, not mechanical. (2) `facts_default_retrieval_test.go` goldens changed because main's `semanticResultMask` tightens reachability on the branch's corpus. See [[graph-swebench-verdict]], [[p1-m2-fact-sync-state]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_read_input_tokens":545213,"output_tokens":1752,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1802},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1752,"cache_read_input_tokens":545213,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1802,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1802,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"spee