{"parentUuid":"bdcf71da-227e-4fae-b8bf-c17ce4261e7e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5QU841DUmBQvkLyuofw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GGGW7fHWxssVDdBStjvGKi","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p0-docs\ngh pr create --repo entireio/entire-brain --base main --head docs/p0-gate-reconcile \\\n  --title \"docs: reconcile GA gates 9-10 and record provider compatibility\" \\\n  --body 'Closes the last P0 documentation gap: `docs/ga-readiness.md` contradicted itself.\n\n## The contradiction\n\nThe summary line reads **\"P0 GA status: gates 1–11 satisfied\"** and `GA cut — resolved` §1/§2 record gates 9 and 10 as done with evidence. The gate table still marked both pending:\n\n| gate | table said | evidence in the same doc |\n|---|---|---|\n| 9 — release blockers closed on RC SHA | `⏳ verify` | §1: `release:evidence` on the RC SHA, 0 hard integrity flags, 24/24 records with required provenance |\n| 10 — both repos tagged and aligned | `⏳ partial` | §2: `entire-graph` and `entire-brain` both cut `v0.1.0` on the aligned GA SHA |\n\nBoth rows now read done and cite the resolved section instead of restating it. No pending rows remain in the table.\n\n## Provider compatibility since the GA cut\n\nGate 10 pinned an aligned `v0.1.0` ↔ `v0.1.0` pair. `entire-graph` has since shipped `v0.2.0` (2026-07-16) and `v0.3.0` (2026-08-14) while this repo stays at `v0.1.0`, so the tags are no longer numerically aligned. The new section records why the gate still holds:\n\n- `entire-graph` `v0.3.0` advertises `SchemaVersion = \"1.1\"` — the version cut at GA, inside the additive-only `1.x` major that ADR 0001 freezes.\n- The emitted `record_type` set is unchanged: `file`, `symbol`, `relation`, `external`, `summary`.\n- The brain invokes `entire graph snapshot` and `entire graph doctor` only, never `entire graph search`, so search-path work (multi-resolution prose retrieval and its `--single-resolution` / `--document-resolution` switches) cannot reach the ingestion path.\n\nNo brain-side adaptation is required to run against `v0.3.0`. The section states the re-check trigger: an `entire-graph` **major** bump, which by ADR 0001 is the only release permitted to break the reader.\n\nDocumentation only — no code, no behavior change.' 2>&1 | tail -3","description":"Open P0 gate reconcile PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1112,"cache_read_input_tokens":550858,"output_tokens":928,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1112,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":928,"cache_read_input_tokens":550858,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1112,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1112},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5QU5q4MBi94wk5GP9ax","type":"assistant","uuid":"5ca675a9-52dc-40af-8a0c-1ef4c7133f54","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:31:18.353Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p0-docs","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
