{"parentUuid":"3b4310a2-bc83-4bcf-9cb0-aecc863714c6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14953500 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"587ee12e-2ff5-4595-9015-ecb6a1ed4883","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:43:41.030Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"587ee12e-2ff5-4595-9015-ecb6a1ed4883","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5RRtXE58HF4PncBsLhX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Here's the full picture. **The repo moved a lot since my last briefing, and that changed most of the answers.**\n\n## What happened while we were away\nEverything I briefed you on **has already merged.** The repo jumped from 07-30 to 08-14:\n\n- **#73** (P0 docs) merged 08-07 — Thomas took the branch over and grew it to 96 files\n- **#74** (my git-meta fact store) merged 08-07\n- **#75** merged 08-08\n- Plus **#76–#83**: short-term memory, conversation recall, privacy/retention, Bugbot findings, correctness repair\n\nI nearly force-pushed over Thomas's work on #73. `--force-with-lease` rejected it — that guard did its job.\n\n## Open PRs in entire-brain: **zero** (before my two)\nNothing was left to merge. So instead I found and closed the one real remaining P0 gap, and revived the P1 work that never landed.\n\n## P0 — closed, in PR #84\n`docs/ga-readiness.md` contradicted itself: the summary said *\"gates 1–11 satisfied\"*, and the resolved section documented gates 9 and 10 as done with evidence, but the **table still marked both ⏳**. Fixed both rows, zero pending rows remain. CI is green except the slow Windows test; a watcher merges it the moment that finishes.\n\n## entire-graph #104 — brain needs **no** adaptation\nVerified, not assumed:\n- Brain calls only `graph snapshot` (31 sites) and `graph doctor` (10). It **never calls `graph search`** — and #104 touches only the search path.\n- Their own evidence: 30/30 code-search payloads byte-identical; prose mode needs ≥4 units and ≥80% doc paths, unreachable from a source repo.\n\n**But I found something bigger than #104:** entire-graph has shipped **v0.2.0 and v0.3.0** while brain sits at v0.1.0 — so gate 10's \"aligned tags\" claim was quietly stale. The contract still holds: **v0.3.0 still advertises `SchemaVersion = \"1.1\"`**, same `record_type` set (`file/symbol/relation/external/summary`), additive-only inside the 1.x major ADR 0001 freezes. I documented that, plus the re-check trigger (a **major** bump is the only release allowed to break the reader).\n\nAlso: my Windows flock fix is **redundant** — main already has `filelock_unix.go` / `filelock_windows.go`. Dropped it.\n\n## P1 — revived, in PR #85\nM1.3/M1.4/transport were still absent from main. Rebased onto current main (one real conflict in `facts_sync_cmd.go`, where main's local durable queue and my hosted publish are complementary — kept both; the caller already did both):\n\n- **M1.3** canonical encoding — closes all four hazards the contract doc names\n- **M1.4** ed25519 manifest signing over canonical bytes, committing to every blob digest\n- **#64's deferrals** — proposal transport + `facts proposals {list,show,apply,reject}`, no-op on the local backend so the default flow never touches the network\n\nGreen: build, **Windows cross-build**, vet, gofmt, all 9 packages.\n\n## Still pending elsewhere\n**entire-api #242** — open since 07-17, untouched, still `CONFLICTING`. That's the server half of #85's transport. My rebased server work sits in `p0p1/api-242` unpushed; it needs re-doing against api's current main, since brain's main moved this much.\n\nWant me to refresh #242 against its current main and push, so the two halves land together?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":317,"cache_read_input_tokens":567094,"output_tokens":1205,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":317,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1205,"cache_read_input_tokens":567094,"cache_creation_input_tokens":317,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":317},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5RRrTT5am9sGs96LiLt","type":"assistant","uuid":"121ede9b-e8ee-4586-bcdb-63993e9735b6","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:44:11.343Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
