{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","prNumber":85,"prUrl":"https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/85","prRepository":"entireio/entire-brain","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:56:31.668Z"}
{"parentUuid":"ae59bb9e-6a04-4b5b-aebc-1bcf4b5975c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5SQh7y3aUpJVbKEhHVc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# ✅ P0 is closed\n\n**#84 merged.** Main is `47df3314`. Gate table on main: **all 11 gates ✅, zero pending rows** — the self-contradiction is gone and the doc now matches its own evidence.\n\n## Where everything stands\n\n**entire-brain — 1 open PR**\n- **#85** — P1 (canonical encoding + manifest signing + proposal transport). Green except the slow Windows test. **Awaiting your call to merge** — it's 5.4K lines of new wire-format code that nobody but me has read, and a wire format is expensive to change after it ships.\n\n**entire-api — 1 open PR**\n- **#242** — the server half of #85's transport. Open since 07-17, conflicting against its current main.\n\n## What P0 closing actually took\nNot what I expected going in. The code was all merged already (#73–#83 landed 08-07/08-08 while we were away). The only thing genuinely left was a **documentation lie**: the summary claimed \"gates 1–11 satisfied\" while the table still showed 9 and 10 pending. Now consistent.\n\nPlus one thing nobody had noticed: **entire-graph shipped v0.2.0 and v0.3.0** while brain stayed at v0.1.0, silently invalidating gate 10's \"aligned tags\" wording. The contract still holds — v0.3.0 emits the same `SchemaVersion = \"1.1\"`, same record types, additive-only under ADR 0001 — and that's now written down along with the re-check trigger (a major bump).\n\n**On #104 specifically: no brain adaptation needed.** Brain never calls `graph search`; it uses `snapshot` and `doctor` only.\n\n## Next\nTwo things, both yours to greenlight:\n1. **Merge #85** on green, or hold it for review\n2. **Refresh #242** against api's current main so both halves of P1 land together\n\nI'd do #242 either way, since it's stale regardless. Want me to start on it?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":778,"cache_read_input_tokens":572023,"output_tokens":645,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":778,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":645,"cache_read_input_tokens":572023,"cache_creation_input_tokens":778,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":778},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5SQeRVYatQiQ2oddFW5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e25531a5-0ada-4388-8fc7-ccd9d4487fcb","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:56:45.778Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
