{"parentUuid":"9b401eb0-7d7e-4df8-9a08-e511f54eb2d5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"9b632cc4-8ae4-4a21-90b3-b370830204c2","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016TrUTKeaynWRnA4SfM3ZKa","type":"tool_result","content":"=== graph #97 ===\nfeat: add experimental SCIP snapshot export +1090 files=14\n---\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- add experimental `snapshot --format scip` output using the standard [SCIP](https://scip-code.org) protobuf schema\r\n- keep native NDJSON and compact NDJSON behavior unchanged while reporting unsupported or incomplete relations in a JSON stderr note\r\n- preserve deterministic output and explicit committed-tree versus worktree provenance\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- `go test ./...`\r\n- `go vet ./...`\r\n- `go test -race ./...`\r\n- focused SCIP, compact snapshot, and CLI tests under the race detector\r\n- built the binary and passed all 151 status-line integration assertions\r\n- exported this repository twice with byte-identical protobuf and note output; `protoc --decode_raw` accepted the result\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nSCIP is a navigation-oriented projection and is intentionally lossier than the nati\n\n=== does it change the DEFAULT snapshot output? ===\nAGENTS.md\nREADME.md\ndocs/DETAILS.md\ndocs/semantic_provider_requirements.md\ngo.mod\ngo.sum\ninternal/cli/help.go\ninternal/cli/help_test.go\ninternal/cli/root.go\ninternal/cli/root_test.go\ninternal/sem/compact_snapshot.go\ninternal/sem/compact_snapshot_test.go","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"024427b8-9d18-480a-b458-51b8a2db2b4f","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:08:55.156Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"=== graph #97 ===\nfeat: add experimental SCIP snapshot export +1090 files=14\n---\n## Summary\r\n\r\n- add experimental `snapshot --format scip` output using the standard [SCIP](https://scip-code.org) protobuf schema\r\n- keep native NDJSON and compact NDJSON behavior unchanged while reporting unsupported or incomplete relations in a JSON stderr note\r\n- preserve deterministic output and explicit committed-tree versus worktree provenance\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- `go test ./...`\r\n- `go vet ./...`\r\n- `go test -race ./...`\r\n- focused SCIP, compact snapshot, and CLI tests under the race detector\r\n- built the binary and passed all 151 status-line integration assertions\r\n- exported this repository twice with byte-identical protobuf and note output; `protoc --decode_raw` accepted the result\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nSCIP is a navigation-oriented projection and is intentionally lossier than the nati\n\n=== does it change the DEFAULT snapshot output? ===\nAGENTS.md\nREADME.md\ndocs/DETAILS.md\ndocs/semantic_provider_requirements.md\ngo.mod\ngo.sum\ninternal/cli/help.go\ninternal/cli/help_test.go\ninternal/cli/root.go\ninternal/cli/root_test.go\ninternal/sem/compact_snapshot.go\ninternal/sem/compact_snapshot_test.go","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9b401eb0-7d7e-4df8-9a08-e511f54eb2d5","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
