{"parentUuid":"3802abc7-8b75-484d-a9c6-4354cf2c45e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8Tq1nfk2DwoLpWgesYm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Work list\n\n## entire-brain\n| # | item | state | blocked on |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **#85** P1: canonical encoding + signing + proposal transport | open, **CLEAN**, 15 pass, reviewed, 2 fix commits landed on it | **your design call on items 1 & 2** |\n| 2 | **Reconcile vendored gitmeta** against api's canonical `internal/gitmeta` + add a drift test | not started | nothing — I can do it |\n| 3 | P0 | ✅ **closed** (#84 merged 08-15, all 11 gates ✅) | — |\n\n**#85's two blockers** (from the maintainer review, quoted):\n1. **Accepted settlements don't stick** — losing member's local facts never reconciled to a hosted resolution; next sync re-raises the conflict under a fresh ID\n2. **Local `facts review` has no hosted interlock** — settling locally leaves the hosted copy open; a teammate's apply silently overrides it\n\nThree more flagged but *not* merge blockers: no server-side settled-ID tombstone, `distill --force` clobbers `proposals.ndjson`, orphaned proposals with a missing head are unremovable.\n\n## entire-api\n| # | item | state | blocked on |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 4 | **#242** P1 server half (server store + fact-sync + remote MCP + tenancy) | open, **untouched since 07-17**, stale/conflicting | needs refresh — I can do it |\n\nNot ours: #617 factsrelay (separate subsystem, incident fix by pfleidi).\n\n## entire-graph\n| # | item | state | brain impact |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 5 | **#104** prose retrieval by section (mine) | open, CLEAN | **none** — search path only |\n| 6 | **#97** SCIP snapshot export (ashtom) | open, CLEAN | **none** — opt-in `--format scip`, NDJSON unchanged |\n| — | v0.3.0 shipped 08-14 | — | **none** — still `SchemaVersion 1.1`, additive-only |\n\n## git-meta-service\n| # | item | action |\n|---|---|---|\n| 7 | **#1** | **close as POC-superseded** — real implementation lives in entire-api |\n\n---\n\n## Ordered by what unblocks the most\n\n1. **Decide #85 items 1 & 2** — only thing between P1's client half and merge. Yours.\n2. **Refresh #242** — a month stale regardless of #85; it's the server half #85 talks to. Mine.\n3. **Re-vendor + drift-test gitmeta** — latent interop break that activates when shared publication unblocks. Mine.\n4. **Close git-meta-service #1** — one command. Needs your ok since it's closing a PR.\n5. **#104 / #97** — no brain action; merge whenever you and ashtom want.\n\nI can start 2 and 3 right now without any decision from you. Which first?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1955,"cache_read_input_tokens":590395,"output_tokens":994,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1955,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":994,"cache_read_input_tokens":590395,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1955,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1955},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8TpwKXvZpr2TJP8hMVh","type":"assistant","uuid":"9a05e2d4-adae-4663-a0ef-cb3be9fbe902","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:17:11.507Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
