{"parentUuid":"6093cebf-9492-4e24-868a-fb09e07d8b70","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8VhDcaPa3pAKPPkEopF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FAPWJknsJEPVVhDVQug2oE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/api-242\ngo test ./internal/httpapi/ ./internal/brainbuild/... ./internal/brainstore/... ./internal/brainquery/... -count=1 -short 2>&1 | grep -E \"^(ok|FAIL|---)\" | head -8\necho \"=== commit merge + tag fix ===\"\ngit add internal/httpapi/tags.go\ngit commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(httpapi): declare the brain OpenAPI tag\n\nEvery brain operation carried the tag \"brain\" without declaring it in apiTags, so\nTestOpenAPITagCatalogInvariants failed for all nine of them — publish, facts\ncurrent/advance, the proposal endpoints and the remote MCP surface. The invariant\nlanded on main after this branch was cut, which is why the gap only surfaces now.\n\nGrouped with git-meta and records: like those, the brain's shared fact set is a\ngit-backed repo metadata store rather than a product read-model.\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3\necho \"=== push (PR only, no merge) ===\"\ngit push origin HEAD:m4-brain-auth --quiet 2>&1 | tail -2\nsleep 6\ngh pr view 242 --repo entirehq/entire-api --json mergeable,mergeStateStatus,additions,changedFiles --jq '\"\\(.mergeable)/\\(.mergeStateStatus) +\\(.additions) files=\\(.changedFiles)\"'","description":"Commit and push api-242 progress"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2509,"cache_read_input_tokens":684239,"output_tokens":1073,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":473},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2509,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_toke