{"parentUuid":"cb676c9f-16b2-4c41-8d99-2cbb0a196ecf","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14903614 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1b691fc8-e8b3-4edc-9899-11ef23f8ef9e","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:42:18.532Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/api-242","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"type":"file-history-delta","messageId":"6753a8b1-20a0-4e13-9989-6b66ece1b201","snapshotMessageId":"4f4a368f-482f-4251-9583-a428d82317b6","trackingPath":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/p1-client-server-interop-fork.md","backup":{"backupFileName":null,"version":1,"backupTime":"2026-08-17T14:42:32.777Z","realParentDir":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory"},"timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:42:32.798Z"}
{"parentUuid":"1b691fc8-e8b3-4edc-9899-11ef23f8ef9e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8VmMWCgbYdJFYL8VHwR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AAnm1kzujEWAESVURBQjWs","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/p1-client-server-interop-fork.md","content":"---\nname: p1-client-server-interop-fork\ndescription: P1's brain client (#85) and entire-api server (#242) proposal-queue halves disagree on paths, settle model, AND proposal-id derivation — P1 cannot work end-to-end until reconciled\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nFound 2026-08-17 while making P1 merge-ready. The two halves of the open-proposal queue were built independently and **do not agree on the wire at three levels**, so no proposal can be addressed across it. P1 would fail end-to-end today.\n\n| | brain client (entire-brain #85, `internal/factsync/httpproposals.go`) | api server (entire-api #242, `internal/httpapi/brain_proposals.go`) |\n|---|---|---|\n| collection path | `/api/v1/repos/{id}/brain/facts/proposals` | `/repos/{repo_id}/brain/proposals` |\n| settle | `POST .../{id}/resolve`, decision in body | `POST .../{id}/apply` + `.../{id}/reject` |\n| proposal id | `sha256(action, candidateID, targetID, branch, proposedBy)` truncated to **16** hex | `sha256(branch, baseRef, contentRef)` full **64** hex |\n\nThe id divergence is fatal — different inputs AND different lengths.\n\n**The api side should move**, because: (1) **ADR-P1-E says the merge runs on the runner**, and api's `ProposalStore.Apply` computes resolutions server-side, contradicting it — the client is ADR-correct (computes the resolved set, CAS-pushes with `factsOldRef`/`proposalsOldRef`); (2) api already serves `/brain/facts` + `/brain/facts/advance`, so `/brain/facts/proposals` is the consistent family; (3) the client half is reviewed and hardened, the server half is not.\n\nFix shape: a `resolve` endpoint taking `{branch, decision, factsOldRef, data, proposalsOldRef, proposals}` → `{factsRef, proposalsRef, changed}`, 412/409 on CAS loss, 404 on unknown id — mirroring the existing `advanceBrainFacts` over `FactSetStore.Current`/`Advance`. The proposal set needs an equivalent CAS'd-blob seam; the Postgres `ProposalIndex` can remain a read-model behind it but must not be the wire surface. **Deliberately not implemented** — it is an architecture call, recorded as a comment on #242.\n\nAlso fixed on #242 while there: merged 734 commits of main (zero conflicts) and declared the missing `brain` OpenAPI tag, which `TestOpenAPITagCatalogInvariants` (added to main after the branch was cut) was failing on for all nine brain operations. #242 is now MERGEABLE. See [[p0-p1-completion-worktrees]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_read_input_tokens":688148,"output_tokens":1077,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1077,"cache_read_input_tokens":688148,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1642},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8VmH63gsaHchFnKJj2B","type":"assistant","uuid":"6753a8b1-20a0-4e13-9989-6b66ece1b201","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:42:32.766Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/api-242","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
