{"parentUuid":"e9340d9c-fe3e-4c96-aad3-7f7f82b49c82","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/MEMORY.md","snippet":"59\t- [VERIFY command fails fairness](verify-command-fails-fairness.md) — a runnable test command is arm-asymmetric HELP not tool output; keep it out of eg tool block\n60\t- [claude --safe-mode strips MCP](claude-safe-mode-strips-mcp.md) — silently removes ALL MCP servers; only check = ask model its tools\n61\t- [Usage is NOT the lever](usage-is-not-the-lever.md) — more graph calls = WORSE (corr −0.166); call count is a difficulty signal\n62\t- [Agentic token saving is the clamp](agentic-token-saving-is-the-clamp.md) — CAUSAL: frugality prompt not graph; unclamped −25.8%→−0.9%\n63\t- [Graph savings scale with session length](graph-savings-scale-with-session-length.md) — saves by deleting locate turns; short-session tiers unreachable\n64\t\n65\t- [Paired deltas decay with n](paired-deltas-decay-with-n.md) — +2.00 at n=400 became −0.39 at n=1540; never report a benchmark delta before full n\n66\t- [mem0 is more context-efficient](mem0-is-more-context-efficient.md) — 43.2 vs our 5.7 pts/1k chars; top_k equalises items not context; the cost of 0-LLM ingest\n67\t- [P1 client/server interop fork](p1-client-server-interop-fork.md) — brain #85 client and api #242 server disagree on proposal paths, settle model AND id derivation (16 vs 64 hex); api side must move per ADR-P1-E; P1 can't work end-to-end until settled"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"cbb8904e-535f-48a3-bfff-2dc24810fb69","timestamp":"2026-08-17T14:42:42.878Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
