{"parentUuid":"93506fc9-03ee-4b1c-a122-91bf3f6c0814","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"4fbb6126-aa62-41ea-b59e-5a8509d6c50d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014YQbkb3T3cs4scimP8pRuG","type":"tool_result","content":"#85: MERGEABLE/CLEAN  +7463/-57 files=33\n=== commits on #85 ===\n75c0afc8 docs(factgitmeta): point the vendored engine at its real upstream\n4e971477 test(brainwire): fuzz the canonical encoding and the signature\nf59c760d test(brief): stop the git-intent tests failing on a loaded machine\nc7ce1b19 fix(facts): close the proposal-queue lifecycle gaps and drop a sync round-trip\n5b17f2a3 fix(facts): make hosted settlements stick and interlock local review\n2d8dd890 fix: bound canonical nesting, scope queue egress, close ledger windows\nc64327e4 fix: harden canonicalization interop and proposal-queue lifecycle per review\nb3d56dc2 Merge remote-tracking branch 'entireio/main' into pr85\n2cb87066 Merge remote-tracking branch 'entireio/main' into pr85\n68d04b35 feat(factsync): hosted open-proposal transport + `facts proposals` CLI\nf2b331cc feat(brainwire): cross-implementation manifest signing\nad462001 feat(brainwire): canonical wire encoding for the brain artifact\n=== CI ===\n  15 pass    1 skipping","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d41f8c5e-5e49-41d2-95e9-832742795d07","timestamp":"2026-08-17T16:21:31.898Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"#85: MERGEABLE/CLEAN  +7463/-57 files=33\n=== commits on #85 ===\n75c0afc8 docs(factgitmeta): point the vendored engine at its real upstream\n4e971477 test(brainwire): fuzz the canonical encoding and the signature\nf59c760d test(brief): stop the git-intent tests failing on a loaded machine\nc7ce1b19 fix(facts): close the proposal-queue lifecycle gaps and drop a sync round-trip\n5b17f2a3 fix(facts): make hosted settlements stick and interlock local review\n2d8dd890 fix: bound canonical nesting, scope queue egress, close ledger windows\nc64327e4 fix: harden canonicalization interop and proposal-