{"parentUuid":"2802b02c-d1f2-41fb-8a8d-5d85cf576a75","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8hTs3rZc1yb6DWDuqoL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# All open PRs — ready or not\n\n## Fully ready ✅\n| PR | what | state |\n|---|---|---|\n| **entire-brain #85** | P1 client: canonical encoding, manifest signing, proposal transport + all the bug/perf/accuracy fixes | **MERGEABLE/CLEAN, CI 15/15** |\n| **entire-graph #104** | prose retrieval by section + benchmark kit | **MERGEABLE/CLEAN** |\n| **graphmark #70** | exclude build output + case-variant repos from bench | **MERGEABLE/CLEAN** |\n| **graphmark #69** | make the harness symmetric by default | **MERGEABLE/CLEAN** |\n\nAll four need only a review. Nothing mechanical is blocking them.\n\n## Ready to merge, but shouldn't be merged yet ⚠️\n| PR | issue |\n|---|---|\n| **entire-api #242** | `MERGEABLE/BLOCKED` (needs approval) — but **merging it as-is ships a P1 that can't talk to itself.** Its wire disagrees with #85 on paths, settle model, and proposal-id derivation (16-hex vs 64-hex). Fix the wire first. |\n\n## Needs work ❌\n| PR | issue |\n|---|---|\n| **entire-api #333** | `CONFLICTING/DIRTY` — DeepSeek/Fireworks checkpoint analysis, stale since 07-23, needs a rebase |\n| **entire-api #603** | `UNSTABLE` — CI failing, `/me` push attribution |\n| **entire-api #487** | `UNSTABLE` — CI failing, Microsoft-gated checkpoint analysis |\n| **git-meta-service #1** | `BLOCKED` — **close this, don't merge.** It's the POC repo; the real engine shipped in entire-api |\n\n## Not mine, worth knowing\n- **entire-graph #97** (ashtom) — SCIP snapshot export, draft, CLEAN. No brain impact (opt-in format, NDJSON unchanged).\n- **graphmark #56** (ashtom) CLEAN; **#54** (ashtom) CONFLICTING.\n- entire-api has ~20 other open PRs from the wider team.\n\n---\n\n## The short version\n**4 of my PRs are genuinely ready to merge today.** One (#242) is mechanically ready but semantically wrong to merge before the wire reconciliation. Three need CI/rebase work. One should be closed.\n\n**P1 finishes when:** the #85 ↔ #242 wire is reconciled → both merge → then the live cross-repo round-trip that #64 deferred and nobody has ever run.\n\nWant me to take the three failing/stale entire-api PRs (#333 rebase, #603 and #487 CI) next, or go at the #242 wire reconciliation?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":984,"cache_read_input_tokens":827696,"output_tokens":955,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":984,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":955,"cache_read_input_tokens":827696,"cache_creation_input_tokens":984,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":984},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8hTmHLWhHdbRey5wEzs","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ef8750a-840b-4fe9-b3fc-2eb644c5536c","timestamp":"2026-08-17T17:15:57.644Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
