{"parentUuid":"78bc9014-ac4c-462a-a815-ba2e3bac0164","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8iFhoGL5XLYyWXgsA4A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":829635,"output_tokens":1087,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":255},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1087,"cache_read_input_tokens":829635,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8iFVtubfvRs96cKW5tX","type":"assistant","uuid":"248c65b1-7023-4c48-8ede-b9b7a1cd02ef","timestamp":"2026-08-17T17:26:12.144Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"248c65b1-7023-4c48-8ede-b9b7a1cd02ef","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce8iFhoGL5XLYyWXgsA4A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Careful — I fixed everything **in entire-brain**. I did *not* fix the api side, and that's exactly what blocks a verified P1.\n\n# PRs that must merge for P1\n\n| # | repo | what | ready? |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **#85** | entire-brain | P1 client half — canonical encoding, manifest signing, proposal transport, all bug/perf/accuracy fixes | ✅ **MERGEABLE/CLEAN, CI 15/15** |\n| **#242** | entire-api | P1 server half — server store, fact-sync, remote MCP, tenancy, proposal endpoints | ⚠️ mechanically mergeable, **but its wire doesn't match #85** |\n\nThat's the whole list. Two PRs.\n\n# Why P1 isn't \"fully verified\" yet\n\n**1. The wire mismatch is still open — I didn't fix it.**\n\n| | #85 (client) | #242 (server) |\n|---|---|---|\n| path | `/brain/facts/proposals` | `/brain/proposals` |\n| settle | `POST .../{id}/resolve` | `POST .../{id}/apply` + `/reject` |\n| proposal id | `sha256(action,candidate,target,branch,proposedBy)` → **16 hex** | `sha256(branch,baseRef,contentRef)` → **64 hex** |\n\nMerging both today gives you a P1 whose two halves cannot address the same proposal. I left this deliberately: which storage seam the queue gets is an architecture call, and #242's `ProposalStore.Apply` resolving server-side contradicts ADR-P1-E (\"merge runs on the runner\"). My recommendation — api moves to the client's shape — is written up on #242.\n\n**2. The live round-trip has never been run.** #64 deferred it and it's still deferred. Everything on both sides is proven against fakes; the real wire has never carried a single request. That's precisely what would have caught the mismatch above.\n\n# So, honestly\n- **Fixed and ready: #85.** Bugs, performance, accuracy, fuzz coverage — done and green.\n- **Not fixed: the api half.** One decision away from being mechanical work.\n- **Never verified: the end-to-end path.**\n\nP1 is \"brain-side complete\", not \"fully verified\". Say the word and I'll do the #242 reconciliation — I'd move api to the client's shape and reuse the `advanceBrainFacts` CAS pattern that already works there — then run the round-trip so it's verified rather than assumed."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_read_input_tokens":829635,"output_tokens":1087,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":255},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1087,"cache_read_input_tokens":829635,"cache_creation_input_tokens":133,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":133},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce8iFVtubfvRs96cKW5tX","type":"assistant","uuid":"598378bc-7fff-44ea-879f-2bdce288c8bf","timestamp":"2026-08-17T17:26:22.706Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p1-new","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
