{"parentUuid":"4af6dc32-e19a-4911-9f48-124f5161e247","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d8e78a40-bc15-4843-b6d2-87d39b823ce8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"would my prosed fix it; Suhaan  [1:59 PM]\nhmm, yeah should make it a clean unified start up process, what do you think of a terminal setup onboarding for brain? (edited) \nashtom  [2:00 PM]\nProblem is, the agent stuff is always going to run long\n[2:00 PM]Unless the repo has no or few sessions yet\n[2:00 PM]And then people probably forget to run it\nSuhaan  [2:01 PM]\nwe could have it were it can run the agent stuff in the background and then update as it comes? (edited) \nashtom  [2:01 PM]\nLike a daemon?\n[2:01 PM]But would you run that across all the repos?\n[2:01 PM]We almost need a singular brain daemon then\nSuhaan  [2:02 PM]\nyeah, we would need that; is it the hard diff problem rihgt? so we could have a tmerinal setup u o and then peoplec an runa  comamdn to see progress of brain in repo and use wtv flows in that the time and what is the role of a daemon then?"},"uuid":"50b3e33a-4276-4f12-be1f-2ad77df26c51","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:04:07.877Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
