{"parentUuid":"828815b2-ea83-4420-8f7c-667ed33304a9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAf6vfLGm7ZyjgaNvMB8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44,"cache_read_input_tokens":74986,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":74986,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAf6sjxoR7zpKxabKshb","type":"assistant","uuid":"e85e8765-4a45-4ded-958f-9e5efda752ff","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:06:04.069Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"e85e8765-4a45-4ded-958f-9e5efda752ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAf6vfLGm7ZyjgaNvMB8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Brain onboarding plan**\n\n**One command: `entire brain setup`**\n\n1. **Instant part (seconds, blocking):** build the code graph + index. Brain is usable immediately — no agent, no tokens.\n2. **Slow part (background, non-blocking):** kick off fact extraction over past sessions, newest first, so the most useful facts land early. Setup returns the prompt right away.\n3. **Staying fresh (no one has to remember):** the session-end hook distills each session as it finishes — already built. After backfill, there's never a big batch job again.\n4. **Progress:** `entire brain status` shows \"facts: 120/900 sessions distilled.\" Doctor stays the health check.\n5. **No daemon:** a git-maintenance-style scheduled job catches up cold repos. Long-term, the \"singular brain daemon\" is the hosted brain (P1) — extraction runs server-side, one place for all repos.\n\n**The pitch in one line:** setup makes the brain usable in 30 seconds and it gets smarter in the background — the agent work still runs long, but nobody waits on it and nobody has to remember it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44,"cache_read_input_tokens":74986,"output_tokens":444,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":444,"cache_read_input_tokens":74986,"cache_creation_input_tokens":44,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":44},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAf6sjxoR7zp