{"parentUuid":"b0877b65-665d-4b2f-a3bd-be3398ec6496","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfCm7miqD9jN7ZHMyJS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":79467,"output_tokens":848,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":157},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":79467,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfChxGN3VpA5Yu7vGpi","type":"assistant","uuid":"ac5bc2c3-5181-4724-89c0-d3152359e965","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:07:33.004Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"ac5bc2c3-5181-4724-89c0-d3152359e965","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfCm7miqD9jN7ZHMyJS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed before writing it in: the singular daemon Thomas asked for already exists — `entire-brain workspace watch` (\"Keep every repo in a workspace fresh automatically\"), with a repo registry (`workspace create`/`add`), a persisted cursor so restarts never re-spend tokens, and all agent work gated by `--distill-every` + `--budget` on a cheap model. Here's the plan with it in:\n\n---\n\n**Brain onboarding plan**\n\n**One command: `entire brain setup`**\n\n1. **Instant (seconds, blocking):** build the code graph + index. Brain usable immediately — no agent, no tokens.\n2. **Backfill (background):** start fact extraction over past sessions, newest first, so useful facts land early. Setup returns the prompt right away.\n3. **The daemon — mostly built (`workspace watch`):** setup registers the repo into the workspace and makes sure one `workspace watch` daemon is running (launchd/systemd). One daemon covers **all** repos:\n   - free deterministic refresh on every change (sessions, index, overlay)\n   - agent work (distill/seed) gated: at most once per interval, budget-capped, cheap model, cursor persisted so restarts never double-spend\n4. **Per-session freshness:** the session-end hook distills each session as it ends — already built. Between daemon and hook, nobody ever has to remember to run anything.\n5. **Progress:** `entire brain status` shows \"facts: 120/900 sessions distilled.\" Doctor stays the health check.\n\n**Pitch:** setup = usable in 30 seconds + registered with the one brain daemon. The agent work still runs long — but in the background, budget-gated, across every repo, and nobody waits on it or has to remember it. Long-term the same daemon role moves server-side with the hosted brain (P1).\n\n---\n\nWhat's genuinely new to build is small: the `setup` wizard itself, daemon install/registration glue (launchd/systemd unit), and the backfill progress counter in `status`. The watch loop, workspace registry, token gating, and session-end hook are already in the repo."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_read_input_tokens":79467,"output_tokens":848,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":157},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":79467,"cache_creation_input_tokens":634,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":634},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfChxGN3VpA5Yu7vGpi","type":"assistant","uuid":"05b3e6df-b92c-439d-a056-f3543bdccb41","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:07:33.044Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
