{"parentUuid":"d15901cb-e6d3-4423-940b-42bb8759f7e7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfRdFrcC7y2uNNn7kS5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WLJLGPSvyN3BHjUGaiQCoh","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /Users/suhaan/devenv/NOTEPAD.md <<'EOF'\n\n---\n\n## 🧠 BRAIN ONBOARDING PLAN (agreed with user 2026-08-18, from ashtom Slack thread)\n\nProblem (ashtom): 3 confusing setup paths (brain w/o agent, w/ agent, facts extraction);\nagent pass is O(sessions) so it always runs long; people forget to run it.\n\nPlan — one command `entire brain setup`:\n1. INSTANT (blocking, seconds): graph + index build. No agent/tokens. Brain usable immediately.\n2. BACKFILL (background): fact extraction over past sessions, NEWEST FIRST. Prompt returns immediately.\n3. DAEMON (mostly built = `workspace watch`): setup registers repo in workspace + ensures ONE\n   workspace-watch daemon running (launchd/systemd). Free deterministic refresh per change; agent\n   steps gated (--distill-every, --budget, cheap model, persisted cursor = no double-spend on restart).\n4. PER-SESSION: `hook session-end` incremental distill (already built) — nothing to remember.\n5. PROGRESS: `entire brain status` → \"facts: 120/900 sessions distilled\". Doctor = health check.\n\nNEW to build (small): setup wizard, daemon install/registration glue (launchd/systemd unit),\nbackfill progress counter in status. Watch loop, workspace registry, gating, hook: ALL EXIST.\nLong-term the daemon role moves server-side (hosted brain, P1).\nEOF\nsed -i '' 's/^Last updated: 2026-08-11.*/Last updated: 2026-08-18 (brain onboarding plan added; keystone work starting)/' /Users/suhaan/devenv/NOTEPAD.md && echo ok","description":"Append brain onboarding plan to NOTEPAD.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2150,"cache_read_input_tokens"