{"parentUuid":"7013916f-126b-448d-bc10-b12df06048c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfScrKpZ1rDzDxZixRB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0197evTSHSkN1sgEbJxD2msN","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-onboarding-plan.md","content":"---\nname: brain-onboarding-plan\ndescription: Agreed brain onboarding fix — `entire brain setup` = instant deterministic core + background newest-first backfill + workspace-watch daemon + session-end hook; daemon wanted by user\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nFrom ashtom Slack thread 2026-08-18: brain onboarding too confusing (3 paths: brain w/o agent,\nw/ agent, facts extraction); agent pass is O(sessions) so always runs long; people forget to run it.\n\nAgreed plan — one command `entire brain setup`:\n1. Instant (blocking, seconds): graph + index. No tokens. Usable immediately.\n2. Backfill (background): distill past sessions NEWEST FIRST; prompt returns immediately.\n3. Daemon — **user explicitly wants it, mostly built**: `entire-brain workspace watch <ws>` keeps\n   every repo in a workspace fresh (free deterministic refresh; agent steps gated by\n   --distill-every/--budget/cheap model; persisted cursor = no re-spend on restart).\n   Setup registers repo + ensures one daemon via launchd/systemd.\n4. Per-session: `hook session-end` incremental distill (built) — nothing to remember.\n5. Progress: `entire brain status` → \"facts: N/M sessions distilled\".\n\nNew to build: setup wizard, daemon install glue (launchd/systemd unit), progress counter in status.\nLong-term daemon role moves server-side (hosted brain, P1). Related: [[git-meta-strategic-context]].\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_read_input_tokens":83202,"output_tokens":667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":28},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":83202,"cache_creation_input_tokens":742,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":742},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfSZDJ85k65VxfVjocL","type":"assistant","uuid":"5d4571fd-e6b3-441c-8868-50a220679192","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:10:38.429Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"5d4571fd-e6b3-441c-8868-50a220679192","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"09307f12-8c15-4f59-82df-0a5869adc23b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0197evTSHSkN1sgEbJxD2msN","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-onboarding-plan.md"}]},"uuid":"27561f97-c6f4-4851-8d34-e6ab6bee4717","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:10:38.439Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brain-onboarding-plan.md","content":"---\nname: brain-onboarding-plan\ndescription: \"Agreed brain onboarding fix — `entire brain setup` = instant deterministic core + background newest-first backfill + workspace-watch daemon + session-end hook; daemon wanted by user\"\nmetadata: \n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af\n  modified: 2026-08-18T18:10:38.434Z\n---\n\nFrom ashtom Slack thread 2026-08-18: brain onboarding too confusing (3 paths: brain w/o agent,\nw/ agent, facts extraction); agent pass is O(sessions) so always runs long; people forget to run it.\n\nAgreed plan — one command `entire brain setup`:\n1. Instant (blocking, seconds): graph + index. No tokens. Usable immediately.\n2. Backfill (background): distill past sessions NEWEST FIRST; prompt returns immediately.\n3. Daemon — **user explicitly wants it, mostly built**: `entire-brain workspace watch <ws>` keeps\n   every repo in a workspace fresh (free deterministic refresh; agent steps gated by\n   --distill-every/--budget/cheap model; persisted cursor = no re-spend on restart).\n   Setup registers repo + ensures one daemon via launchd/systemd.\n4. Per-session: `hook session-end` incremental distill (built) — nothing to remember.\n5. Progress: `entire brain status` → \"facts: N/M sessions distilled\".\n\nNew to build: setup wizard, daemon install glue (launchd/systemd unit), progress counter in status.\nLong-term daemon role moves server-side (hosted brain, P1). Related: [[git-meta-strategic-context]].\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false,"memdirStamped":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5d4571fd-e6b3-441c-8868-50a220679192","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
