lations too?) Paste the Go struct(s) that define the diff output.\n2. Is there a stable entity identity across commits (an entity ID/fingerprint that survives file moves/renames), or is identity just name+file+kind? Where computed?\n3. Is there any existing code mapping entities→commits/checkpoints or any index persisted per-commit? (search: checkpoint, commit, history, index, delta)\n4. What is SchemaVersion of graph output currently, and where is the diff command registered (file:line)?\n5. Does the graph have a programmatic Go API brain could import, or is CLI+JSON the only integration surface? (check go.mod module name + whether internal/ hides everything)\n\nReport in caveman-ultra compressed style: max ~40 lines, file:line for every claim, paste only the key structs. No prose padding.","outputFile":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/ab691a79ea6350449.output","canReadOutputFile":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"9a0edde2-b858-4d66-9e3e-5012aa983cd0","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
