{"parentUuid":"7ddd8de7-f466-42ca-bee9-932c88be73df","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfZTjLj2pshBxFPVLqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5854,"cache_read_input_tokens":84913,"output_tokens":1254,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":691},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5854,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1254,"cache_read_input_tokens":84913,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5854,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5854},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfZQwAXCzaioBorsbrG","type":"assistant","uuid":"b7d99fdf-6e6a-4e28-a79d-6d9c2f84b1ca","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:12:26.534Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"b7d99fdf-6e6a-4e28-a79d-6d9c2f84b1ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfZTjLj2pshBxFPVLqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Short answer: **the backfill is just `distill` run over the session backlog — it uses whatever coding agent is already on the machine, with the user's own auth.** Nothing new.\n\nBreaking that down:\n\n- **Input:** the captured session transcripts the repo already has (`.git/entire-sessions/` exports / checkpoint history). That's the raw material.\n- **Free part first:** export + overlay + index of those transcripts is deterministic — zero tokens. That happens instantly during setup.\n- **Token-spending part:** fact extraction shells out to an agent CLI on PATH — default is `codex`, `claude` also supported — pinned to a **cheap model + low reasoning effort** via the existing `--model`/`--effort` flags. It runs under the developer's own subscription/API key, same as running distill by hand today.\n- **Cost guardrails (already built into watch):** `--budget` caps total agent runs, `--distill-every` rate-limits, and the persisted cursor means a restart never re-spends on sessions already done. Newest-first ordering means the most valuable facts land in the first few minutes even if the tail takes hours.\n- **Long-term:** once the hosted brain (P1) is live, backfill can move server-side — the cell already runs an Anthropic-backed worker for checkpoint analysis, so the same pattern gives you org-paid, server-side extraction and no local agent dependency at all.\n\nSo the honest framing for Thomas: backfill costs the user their own agent tokens on a cheap model, budget-capped, in the background — and that cost disappears to the server side once hosted lands.\n\n(Meanwhile the three Keystone scouts are still running in the background — I'll come back with the plan + questions when they report.)"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5854,"cache_read_input_tokens":84913,"output_tokens":1254,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":691},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5854,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1254,"cache_read_input_tokens":84913,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5854,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5854},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfZQwAXCzaioBorsbrG","type":"assistant","uuid":"eacc1f4b-3206-4bf3-963b-ec971f8853e5","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:12:26.535Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
