{"parentUuid":"98ca5b1f-89b3-4481-8593-4dcba9c1dc3e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfdn9UnEJ5FwRewz9e6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13378,"cache_read_input_tokens":94131,"output_tokens":1764,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1040},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13378,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1764,"cache_read_input_tokens":94131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13378},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfdjPHXEeynckbZxLJL","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Google Drive","attributionMcpTool":"read_file_content","type":"assistant","uuid":"2eaf3119-ba32-4e3b-a08d-04c1ba1ed8d2","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:13:23.111Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"2eaf3119-ba32-4e3b-a08d-04c1ba1ed8d2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAfdn9UnEJ5FwRewz9e6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Roadmap doc pulled — I now have the exact Keystone scope, and the first scout is back. Two scouts (cli checkpoint write path, brain provenance) still running; I'll deliver the full plan + questions when they land.\n\nWhat the Keystone officially is (5 Linear issues, 3 milestones, all currently Canceled in Linear and needing reactivation):\n\n1. **Entity deltas in checkpoint metadata** — COR-781 (spike the schema) + COR-782 (embed deltas in the checkpoint write path). Target was 2026-08-15 — already slipped.\n2. **Git-native entity→checkpoint index** — COR-783 (build it) + COR-784 (MCP tool: \"query checkpoints/sessions by entity\"). Target 2026-09-15.\n3. **Transparency-log causality** — COR-785 (tie ref-change events to the session + entities that caused them). Target 2026-09-30.\n\nDone-when: \"which checkpoints changed entity X\" answered from the index, no re-parsing.\n\nFirst scout's load-bearing findings from entire-graph:\n\n- The delta producer **already exists**: `entire graph diff --base A --head B --json` emits exactly the needed shape (added/removed/modified/renamed/moved per entity, with kind, name, signatures, paths, lines).\n- The graph even has a checkpoint mode already — but it resolves checkpoint→commit by **grepping git log live** (`git log --grep=Entire-Checkpoint:`) with no index. That grep is precisely what the Keystone index replaces.\n- Two gaps that shape the plan: the diff output is **unversioned** (no schema_version field — must be stamped before it's persisted into checkpoint metadata, that's the COR-781 spike), and entity identity is a **content fingerprint recomputed per run**, not a stored stable ID — so the index key choice (name+kind+path vs fingerprint) is a real design decision.\n- Integration surface is **CLI + JSON only** — everything is under `internal/`, so cli/brain shell out to the binary; no Go import possible.\n\nWaiting on the other two scouts, then I'll come back with the composed plan and the questions you need to decide."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13378,"cache_read_input_tokens":94131,"output_tokens":1764,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1040},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13378,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1764,"cache_read_input_tokens":94131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":13378,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":13378},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAfdjPHXEeynckbZxLJL","attributionMcpServer":"claude.ai Google Drive","attributionMcpTool":"read_file_content","type":"assistant","uuid":"cfbe61a1-7d85-43db-857d-cf60af390875","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:13:23.135Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
