{"parentUuid":"8c87cb05-0fdc-48e6-a282-616f38ed21ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAgrmABNR9g3FMSroTjn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":267,"cache_read_input_tokens":121594,"output_tokens":718,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":66},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":267,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":718,"cache_read_input_tokens":121594,"cache_creation_input_tokens":267,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":267},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAgri3QFCMHxqDLa9cam","type":"assistant","uuid":"71d95090-ea7d-43ed-b9bd-1ca480fba0e9","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:29:01.791Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"71d95090-ea7d-43ed-b9bd-1ca480fba0e9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAgrmABNR9g3FMSroTjn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**COR-785 = \"make the audit log explain *why*, not just *what*.\"**\n\nBreaking it down simply:\n\n**What the transparency log is today:** entiredb keeps a tamper-evident, append-only log of every ref change — every time a branch/checkpoint ref moves, there's a signed entry saying \"ref X moved from commit A to commit B, at this time, by this identity.\" Think of it as a security camera on the repo: it records that *something happened*, and nobody can secretly edit the tape.\n\n**What it can't answer:** *why* it happened. The log entry knows \"ref moved A→B\" but has no idea that this was **session `s-123`, where Claude was fixing the auth bug, and the change touched `verifyToken()` and `SessionStore.refresh()`**. That context exists — the session and the entity deltas both exist — but nothing links them to the log entry.\n\n**What COR-785 does:** attach that link. Each ref-change event gets tied to the session that caused it and the entities it changed. Then you can ask causality questions off the tamper-proof record:\n\n- \"Who/what changed `verifyToken()` on main last week?\" → *session s-123, agent claude, checkpoint c-456* — answered from the signed log, not from trust.\n- \"This ref moved at 3am — which agent run did that, and what did it touch?\"\n\n**Why it's the natural third piece:** milestone 1 creates the entity deltas, milestone 2 indexes them locally — COR-785 stitches the same information into the *server-side, tamper-evident* record. It's the compliance/security-grade version of the same answer.\n\n**Why I recommended deferring it:** it's the only keystone piece that lives server-side (entiredb/hosted), so it depends on the P1 rails that are still sitting unmerged in #85/#242 — and the keystone's done-when (\"which checkpoints changed entity X, from the index\") is fully met without it. Building it now means building against a moving target.\n\nWant me to defer it (my recommendation), or include it in this push?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":267,"cache_read_input_tokens":121594,"output_tokens":718,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":66},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":267,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":718,"cache_read_input_tokens":121594,"cache_creation_input_tokens":267,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":267},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAgri3QFCMHxqDLa9cam","type":"assistant","uuid":"08658c1b-aa2c-4812-9f3e-7a772f343f86","timestamp":"2026-08-18T18:29:11.960Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
