{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-18T19:19:54.660Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a9246248f8930dfde</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01C6rS5uzrraNY9krCem6jnA</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/a9246248f8930dfde.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Brain PR: entity-checkpoint index\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Final suite confirmed green. Report:\n\n**PACKAGES/FILES**\n- `internal/entityindex/` NEW: build.go 403, query.go 381, graphdiff.go 198, doc.go 192, state.go 125 (+test 574)\n- `internal/factgitmeta/store.go` NEW 158 — `MetaStore`: shared lock+CAS writer on `refs/meta/local/main` (fact head + index now serialize on ONE lockfile; a 2nd opener would silently drop one namespace's create-path write)\n- `internal/cli/entities_cmd.go` NEW 775, `entities_provenance.go` NEW 215 (+tests 484, live-e2e 178)\n- edits: distill_cmd +13, mcp +20, watch +7, hook_cmd +9, root +1, README +30, docs/getting-started +3\n\n**COMMANDS** `entire brain entities backfill|history|show` (backfill: `--branch --limit --checkpoints-only --full --graph-binary --json`; history: `--branch --limit --json`; show: commit|checkpoint-id, `--summary`)\n**MCP TOOL** `brain_entity_history` (query/branch/limit) → same code path as `entities history --json`\n\n**CONTRACT — 1 forced realization, flag to the parallel cli PR**: `&lt;entitykey&gt;` is hex-encoded into the git-meta key segment. `gitmeta.ValidateKey` REJECTS `/` in a segment and paths always contain one, so a literal splice makes `Serialize` error out. Same precedent as factgitmeta's repoKey/branch. Single source of truth: `entityindex.EntityRecordKey`/`AliasRecordKey`. Added beyond the contract: HWM `project` string `brain:entities-head:&lt;hex(branch)&gt;`.\n\n**LIVE-VERIFIED on-disk** (real repo, real provider): `commit/&lt;shard&gt;/&lt;sha&gt;/brain/entities/__value`, `project/brain/entity/&lt;hex&gt;/__list/&lt;ts&gt;-&lt;h&gt;`, `project/brain/entities-head/6d61696e/__value`; stored doc byte-shape `{\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"producer\":\"entire-graph\",\"base\",\"head\",\"computed_at\",\"entities\":[{change,kind,name,path,signature,start_line}]}`.\n\n**MUTATIONS RUN (3)**\n1. reverse-index `OpListPush` write removed → **9 tests FAILED** (3 entityindex + 6 cli, incl. live e2e)\n2. `anchorFor` always returns fallback → **TestEntityProvenanceResolvesToTheChangingCheckpoint FAILED**; fallback test correctly still passed\n3. cache `MetaTip == tip` pin ignored → **TestEntityIndexCacheRebuildsWhenTheGitMetaTipMoves FAILED**\nAll restored; re-verified green.\n\n**TESTS** 24 new (13 entityindex, 10 cli, 1 live e2e). Live e2e **actually ran** (feature-detects `entire graph capabilities --json`), asserting history names the 2 commits touching `ChargeCard` and excludes the unrelated one. Coverage: build, idempotent re-run (0 extra provider calls), rename→move alias chaining, bounded-pass backward convergence, reverse query, cache rebuild from poisoned pin, provenance resolve+fallback, coexistence with the fact-set writer on the shared ref, MCP schema+dispatch. Full: **2454 passed / 12 packages**, `gofmt -l -s` clean, `go vet ./...` clean.\n\n**NOTES** freshness step is bounded (10 commits, 90s) + failure-silent, in `watchDeterministicRefresh` and in `session-end` (after the durable hint, before distill so provenance sees the session's own commits). `--limit` selects the newest *unindexed* commits so repeated bounded passes converge backwards; the high-water mark only advances when a pass left nothing behind.\n\n**COMMITS** (branch `feat/entity-checkpoint-index`, NOT pushed, tree clean)\n`6355c07c` factgitmeta store · `97c7935e` entityindex · `5de2688c` cli/MCP/freshness/provenance</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>404054</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>229</tool_uses><duration_ms>2628445</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
