     forward doc\nproject/brain/entity/&lt;hex(path#kind#name)&gt;/__list/ reverse\nproject/brain/entities-head/6d61696e/__value       high-water (\"main\")\n{\"schema_version\":\"1.0\",\"producer\":\"entire-graph\",\"base\":..,\"head\":..,\"computed_at\":RFC3339Z,\"entities\":[{\"change\",\"kind\",\"name\",\"path\",\"signature\",\"start_line\"}]}\n```\nDEVIATION (forced, one place): `&lt;entitykey&gt;` is hex-encoded into the git-meta key. gitmeta.ValidateKey REJECTS `/` in a key segment and paths always contain `/` — a literal splice makes Serialize error, not corrupt. Same encoding factgitmeta already uses for repo keys/branches. `EntityRecordKey`/`AliasRecordKey`/`DecodeEntityKey` are the single source; every generated key is ValidateKey-asserted in test. **The parallel cli PR must match this.**\n\nDESIGN CALLS: merge = first-parent diff only; root diffs vs empty tree; `--limit` picks the NEWEST unindexed and converges backwards (limiting the git walk would loop the same window forever); high-water only advances when a pass leaves nothing behind (no truncation/cap/failure); unknown provider change type folds to `modified`; missing `schema_version` tolerated; `applyBatch` replaces folding `State.Apply` (clone-per-mutation = quadratic here), pinned to reference semantics by test.\n\nMUTATIONS RUN (3, all restored):\n1. reverse-index write removed → 9 tests FAIL across both pkgs incl. live e2e\n2. `anchorFor` always returns fallback → `TestEntityProvenanceResolvesToTheChangingCheckpoint` FAILS, fallback test still passes (correct)\n3. cache tip-pin ignored → `TestEntityIndexCacheRebuildsWhenTheGitMetaTipMoves` FAILS\n\nTESTS 24 new (13 entityindex, 10 cli, 1 live e2e). Live e2e **ran, not skipped** — real git repo + real `entire graph diff`, feature-detected via `graph capabilities --json`. Full suite post-commit: **2455 passed / 12 packages, exit 0**; `gofmt -l -s .` and `go vet ./...` clean.\n\nSHAS `6355c07c` factgitmeta store · `97c7935e` entityindex · `5de2688c` cli surfaces</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>370092</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>232</tool_uses><duration_ms>2669184</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
