p), #4a (regresses a shipped verify surface), #5c (self-poisoning cache). #5a/#5b make the \"bounded, token-free tick\" claim untrue in practice.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>145362</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>38</tool_uses><duration_ms>410213</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
