{"parentUuid":"c5ea005e-545c-4a5f-840c-0a31b3f10e51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAoBcKqmTZWbUArhfyBf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cli skeptic came back **NO-SHIP, with measurements** — the doctrine paying for itself again (this is the ~45% kill rate in action). The damning ones: a real 3.5s synchronous stall per session per commit (and the codex session-end path has a 2s budget, so it could literally never succeed there), ranges over ~50 commits time out and silently produce nothing forever, a metadata-copy failure can drop the *whole checkpoint*, and the schema fixture tests diverged from the real producer's keys — which is exactly how the dead `producer_version` field survived its own test.\n\nDispatching one consolidated fix pass for the cli PR (contract checker's + skeptic's findings together). The core pivot: stop computing synchronously in the hook — use the repo's own detached/backfill primitives it already ships for analytics and attribution."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4360,"cache_read_input_tokens":160477,"output_tokens":4096,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1704},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4360,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4096,"cache_read_input_tokens":160477,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4360,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4360},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAoBYvhRsEgt9zSQEpZ5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5b6f40be-277e-4df8-9746-6a2a062e2025","timestamp":"2026-08-18T19:52:28.810Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entry