{"parentUuid":"fd500977-7b36-4d2b-bd58-32ca5ebc641a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAoMot96BrE6hmyZLbnA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Uq1A1nitV6dZWuTR8TLRSw","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat >> /Users/suhaan/devenv/NOTEPAD.md <<'EOF'\n\n### Keystone verification round 1 (adversarial, 2026-08-18): graph SHIP / cli NO-SHIP / brain NO-SHIP\n- graph feat/diff-schema-version b6ddbb7: CLEAN (additive +11/-0, both argv forms same handler). No changes needed.\n- Contract check found 3 doc mismatches (producer_version dead both sides differently; old_name dropped on\n  moved+renamed in cli; start_line=0 on removals in cli). Contract amended: old_name/old_path whenever\n  differ; start_line falls back to before_start_line.\n- cli NO-SHIP (measured): 3.5s sync stall/session/commit in post-commit hook (codex 2s budget = never works);\n  >10s range = silent nothing forever; copyMetadataDir error DROPS WHOLE CHECKPOINT; no size cap (2.1MB doc);\n  multi-session scope bleed; vacuous hang test; fixture drifted from real producer. FIXER RUNNING: pivot to\n  detached BackfillEntityDeltas (SpawnDetached + write-request union), session-file filtering, real fixtures.\n- brain NO-SHIP (proven via overlay probes): --checkpoints-only poisons HWM (permanent index gap);\n  provenance sharpening REGRESSES entire brain verify (STALE downgrades) + cross-session anchor lies;\n  cache self-poisons on one git error; blocking flock can hang session-end; tick re-walks 20k commits.\n  FIXER RUNNING: two-cursor contiguous window replaces HWM; verify taught sharpened anchors; same-session\n  scoping; TryLock tick; no-persist-on-git-error; 5 mutations to re-run.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Record verification round 1 verdicts in notepad"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5727,"cache_read_inp