{"parentUuid":"370911cf-2957-47a3-8c45-68abc71c964a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAoNmypPyuouSu2ndygY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Status check — the verification round did exactly what it exists for:\n\n- **Graph PR: clean, ships as-is.** Purely additive, contract-verified from both consumers' side.\n- **CLI PR: no-ship → fixer running.** Core rework: move the compute out of the synchronous hook path into a detached backfill (the repo's own pattern), plus the schema fixes, session-scoped filtering, size cap, and honest tests regenerated from the *real* producer's output.\n- **Brain PR: no-ship → fixer running.** Core rework: contiguous indexed-window cursors instead of the single high-water mark, verify taught to accept sharpened anchors, sharpening constrained to the fact's own session, non-blocking tick lock, and no cache persistence on git failure — with five mutations to re-run as proof.\n\nBoth skeptics' full findings and the amended contract are in the notepad. Next wake-up is the fixers reporting; then a focused re-verify of the fixed areas, and only what survives gets pushed and opened as PRs — still nothing merged without you."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_read_input_tokens":177950,"output_tokens":350,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":350,"cache_read_input_tokens":177950,"cache_creation_input_tokens":828,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":828},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAoNiBsLJmFLGPZchubZ","type":"assistant","uuid"