{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:31:44.348Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a2ce260f93dd41028</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/a2ce260f93dd41028.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Fix cli PR: async + contract\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>All 14 defects fixed. `mise run check` green, tree clean, nothing pushed.\n\n**Per defect**\n\n1. **Async rework** — `stageEntityDeltas`/`MetadataDir` gone. `scheduleEntityDeltas` (strategy/entity_deltas.go:189) runs *after* `store.Write` (manual_commit_condensation.go:437), writes a small job file, forks `execx.SpawnDetached(repoDir, \"__entity_deltas\", job)`. Child = hidden cmd `cli/entity_deltas_cmd.go` → `RunEntityDeltasBackfill` → producer → `checkpoint.SessionEntityDeltas` backfill. New write request modelled on `CheckpointAttribution`: api/checkpoint/interfaces.go:80, applier persistent.go:289, dispatch persistent_write.go:20 / refs_store.go:122 / fsstore.go:120, routing routing_store.go:254. Timeout 120s (entity_deltas.go:88). Backfills of one commit serialise on a per-repo flock so two sessions can't clobber each other.\n2. **Cannot fail the checkpoint** — scheduler returns nothing; backfill is a different process on an already-committed checkpoint; all errors log+return. Tests: `TestRunEntityDeltasBackfill_WriteErrorLeavesCheckpointIntact`, `TestWriteSessionEntityDeltas_UnknownSessionErrorsWithoutMovingTheRef`.\n3. **Hygiene** — `killEntityDeltasProcessGroupOnCancel` (entity_deltas_cancel_unix.go / _windows.go, Setpgid + kill -pgid). 8MB `cappedBuffer` cap; over-cap → `errEntityDeltasOversized`, Info line, skip.\n4. **producer_version** — decodes real `producer_version` key (entity_deltas.go:126).\n5. **before_start_line** — fallback when after is absent/0 (entityDeltaFromChange).\n6. **old_name** — carried on any change type when it differs from resolved name.\n7. **file-level old_path** — falls back to `file.OldPath`.\n8. **Session scoping** — job carries `WriteOptions.FilesTouched`; `entityDeltasFromDiff` filters on path *or* old_path; empty file set skips the producer.\n9. **One Info line** per condense when gate on + producer missing.\n10. **Tri-state env** — `entityDeltasEnvOverride` (settings.go:1424): 1/true/yes/on force on, 0/false/no/off force off, unset/empty/unknown → settings. Documented (no precedent existed).\n11. **Hang test** — asserts `elapsed &lt; 2s` against a 200ms deadline + sleep-10 stub.\n12. **Argv test** — `TestComputeEntityDeltas_ProducerArgv` asserts exact `[diff --base B --head H --repo D --json]`.\n13. **Fixture** — `strategy/testdata/entity_deltas_producer_diff.json`, captured verbatim from a real `entire-graph` build (commit `b6ddbb72…`, named in the file with capture recipe + coverage list).\n14. **New tests** — strategy: Schedules/DisabledIsNoOp/EnvDisableWins/JobFileIsConsumed/NoFilesSkips/EmptyRangeSkips/ProducerAbsentLogsOneInfoLine/ProducerArgv/ProducerHangIsKilled/OversizedOutputSkips/UnderCapSucceeds/CondenseAndBackfill_WritesEntityDeltasIntoCheckpointTree/RunEntityDeltasBackfill_WriteErrorLeavesCheckpointIntact/RealProducerOutput/FiltersToSessionFiles/OldFieldsFollowTheValues/StartLineFallsBackToBefore/FileOldPathReachesEntities/CappedBuffer. checkpoint: TargetsTheNamedSession/UnknownCheckpointIsNotFound/UnknownSessionErrorsWithoutMovingTheRef/RefsStore_WriteSessionEntityDeltas/fsstore SessionEntityDeltas. settings: EnvForcesOff/EnvForcesOn/EnvUnrecognizedFallsThrough.\n\nAlso live-verified with the real binary + real producer: `entire __entity_deltas &lt;job&gt;` consumes the job, runs the producer, reaches the store write, exits 0, stays hidden from help.\n\nGate default still OFF. Commits on `feat/checkpoint-entity-deltas`: `e8432d01d` (store contract), `f57e55479` (capture). No AI footers. Not pushed.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>312439</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>171</tool_uses><duration_ms>2327068</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
