{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-18T20:36:44.758Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>af2d8bdef6b8059b2</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01FuNNC9RrmHc2t74soeLHNG</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/af2d8bdef6b8059b2.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Fix brain PR: cursors+provenance\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>FIX PASS DONE. `/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-keystone`, branch `feat/entity-checkpoint-index`, NOT pushed.\n\n**1 contiguous window** — `entityindex/doc.go:48,153` (`windowKeyPrefix`, `IndexWindow`/`EncodeWindow`/`DecodeWindow`/`WindowKey`), `build.go:158` Build rewritten: `readWindow` (:274, 1-blob read + ancestor check), `extendWindow` (:340, forward walks ONLY `tip..head`; backward pulls floor, walk `--max-count` bounded by remaining budget), `indexCheckpointCommits` (:425) moves no cursor. `query.go:93` `Window()`. New: `TestBuildCheckpointsOnlyLeavesTheWindowUntouched`, `TestBuildTickWalksOnlyTheNewCommits`, `TestBuildLimitedPassesConvergeBackwards` (now asserts Scanned==1, no re-walk), `TestWindowRecordRoundTrips`.\n\n**2a verify** — `verify_cmd.go:427` accepts any checkpoint the local store owns for the session; `sessionOwnsCheckpoint`/`sessionCheckpoint` (:498); `snapshotSourceTranscriptPath` resolves THAT checkpoint's path; transcript prefix accepted only for non-latest. Backed by new `checkpointSnapshot.SessionCheckpoints` (`export.go:3421`, filled in both snapshot builders). New: `TestVerifySharpenedAnchorOnAnEarlierCheckpointVerifies`, `TestVerifyAnchorOnAForeignCheckpointIsStale`.\n\n**2b scoping** — `entities_provenance.go` rewritten: candidates keyed per-session (`bySession`), branch guard via `sessionBranchByID`, multi-checkpoint commits skipped (ambiguous pairing), byPath ambiguity guard on distinct PATHS, `%cI` committer date. New: `TestEntityProvenanceRefusesAnotherSessionsCheckpoint`.\n\n**3a non-blocking** — `factgitmeta`: `tryLockFile` (unix+windows), `localrepo.tryLock`, `MetaStore.TryLock/TryUpdate/ReadString/HasString`, `ErrLockBusy`; `BuildOptions.NonBlocking` set by `refreshEntityIndexQuietly`. New: `TestMetaStoreTryUpdateDoesNotWaitOnTheLock`, `TestBuildNonBlockingSkipsWhenTheStoreIsLocked`, `TestMetaStoreReadStringMatchesMaterializedState`.\n\n**3b cache poisoning** — `entities_cmd.go:605` `entityCommitMetadata` returns error; `partitionPresentCommits` separates pruned-commit from git-failure; `loadEntityIndexView` never persists a failed rebuild, serves previous + warning. New: `TestEntityIndexCacheIsNotPersistedWhenGitFails`.\n\n**4/5/6 contract** — `graphdiff.go`: decodes real `producer_version` (verified against `entire-graph/internal/sem/model.go` — no `schema_version`, no per-change fingerprint); phantom fingerprint decode dropped, doc field kept with comment; `--repo &lt;dir&gt;` passed explicitly (verified live). New: `TestParseDiffCarriesProviderVersionWhenPresent`, `TestParseDiffRecordsNoFingerprint`, `TestDiffCommitNamesTheRepositoryExplicitly`.\n\n**7** — `state.go:44` in-place set now drops the key tombstone; `TestApplyBatchMatchesReferenceApply` seeded with non-empty state (tombstone+string on one key, pre-existing lists).\n\n**8** — history reset to `origin/main` and re-committed as 3 honest commits; factgitmeta message states Backend was NOT refactored, only lockfile+ref shared; duplication + per-FD flock self-deadlock commented in `store.go:30`.\n\n**9** — primary test is now `TestEntityProvenanceResolvesToAMidSessionCheckpoint` (resolves ckptA ≠ latest ckptB, fails with the feature deleted); fallback test kept separate.\n\n**Extra found+fixed:** reverse-list order is append order (exchange format nudges late older entries), so backfill-backwards answered newest-first — chronology now imposed in the join (`sortOccurrencesByCommitDate`); `TestEntitiesHistoryAnswersOldestFirstAcrossBoundedPasses`.\n\n**MUTATIONS 5/5 KILLED** (compile-breaks excluded as false kills; M1 verified compiling-clean + genuine assertion failure): M1 reverse-index write removed, M2 anchorFor always-fallback, M3 cache tip-pin ignored, M4 cursor-advance-on-checkpoints-only, M5 cache-persist-on-git-error.\n\n**SUITE:** `go test ./...` 2468 passed, 0 failed, 12 pkgs. gofmt clean, `go vet ./...` clean. Live e2e `TestLiveEntityIndexBackfillAndHistory` PASS (0.55s, real `entire graph`, not skipped). One earlier full-run failure (`TestBrainBriefGitIntentLiveShapedOperationalRecall`, \"could not parse HEAD\") was an unrelated real-git flake — green on both re-runs.\n\n**SHAs:** `78d02685` factgitmeta → `edf3a69a` entityindex → `97a487dc` cli. 26 files, +5418/−28. No AI footers, not pushed.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>369325</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>183</tool_uses><duration_ms>2551539</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
