{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","prNumber":114,"prUrl":"https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/114","prRepository":"entireio/entire-graph","timestamp":"2026-08-18T21:10:30.742Z"}
{"parentUuid":"e9428709-3f10-4ce7-b871-b8f326567d01","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAuBDYKyTYrB5K86GTsH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01KMydwMo3jR6ACyzMNAVvKN","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli-keystone && git push -u origin feat/checkpoint-entity-deltas -q && gh pr create --repo entireio/cli --base main --head feat/checkpoint-entity-deltas --title \"Record changed code entities in checkpoint metadata (gated, off by default)\" --body \"Implements the entity-deltas half of the VCS keystone (COR-782): each persistent checkpoint gains an \\`entity_deltas.json\\` in its per-session tree dir recording which code entities (functions/types/methods) the session changed — schema_version 1.0, shared contract with entire-brain's entity→checkpoint index.\n\n**Off by default.** Gated on \\`entity_deltas\\` settings key / \\`ENTIRE_ENTITY_DELTAS\\` env (tri-state: force-on, force-off, fall-through). With the gate off the only cost is the settings read.\n\n**Design — nothing runs in the hook path:**\n- Post-commit condense writes a job file and \\`SpawnDetached\\`s a hidden \\`entire __entity_deltas\\` child; the hook's added cost is spawn only.\n- The child resolves \\`entire-graph\\` (silent skip + one Info line if absent), runs \\`diff --base --head --repo --json\\` (120s cap, process-group kill, 8MB output cap), filters entities to the session's own files, and applies a new \\`SessionEntityDeltas\\` backfill write request (modelled on \\`BackfillAttribution\\`, implemented for all four store backends).\n- The ref advance is **CAS + bounded retry** (re-reads tip, rebuilds on the new parent) so a backfill can never orphan a concurrent condense's checkpoint; the OPF pre-push rewrite takes the entity-deltas lock for its duration so a late child parks instead of aborting a push.\n- Backfill errors are logged and dropped — structurally unable to fail checkpoint creation.\n\n**Verification:** race and rewrite interactions covered by deterministic tests (\\`TestBackfillEntityDeltas_TipMovedUnderTheWrite_KeepsBothCheckpoints\\`, \\`REDACTED\\`, both mutation-verified — reverting the CAS or the rewrite lock fails them with the real failure). Producer fixture captured verbatim from a real \\`entire-graph\\` build (commit noted in the fixture). \\`mise run check\\` green (lint 0, unit+integration, canary e2e 4/4).\" 2>&1 | tail -2","description":"Push cli branch and open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":207518,"output_tokens":941,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":941,"cache_read_input_tokens":207518,"cache_creation_input_tokens":747,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":747},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAuBAfCBAaCMPMUwfpH6","type":"assistant","uuid":"1e190a01-27e3-4e5f-89c7-095644ed7f48","timestamp":"2026-08-18T21:10:43.122Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-keystone","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"1e190a01-27e3-4e5f-89c7-095644ed7f48","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_01KMydwMo3jR6ACyzMNAVvKN","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/cli-keystone && rtk git push -u origin feat/checkpoint-entity-deltas -q && gh pr create --repo entireio/cli --base main --head feat/checkpoint-entity-deltas --title \\\"Record changed code entities in checkpoint metadata (gated, off by default)\\\" --body \\\"Implements the entity-deltas half of the VCS keystone (COR-782): each persistent checkpoint gains an \\\\`entity_deltas.json\\\\` in its per-session tree dir recording which code entities (functions/types/methods) the session changed — schema_version 1.0, shared contract with entire-brain's entity→checkpoint index.\\n\\n**Off by default.** Gated on \\\\`entity_deltas\\\\` settings key / \\\\`ENTIRE_ENTITY_DELTAS\\\\` env (tri-state: force-on, force-off, fall-through). With the gate off the only cost is the settings read.\\n\\n**Design — nothing runs in the hook path:**\\n- Post-commit condense writes a job file and \\\\`SpawnDetached\\\\`s a hidden \\\\`entire __entity_deltas\\\\` child; the hook's added cost is spawn only.\\n- The child resolves \\\\`entire-graph\\\\` (silent skip + one Info line if absent), runs \\\\`diff --base --head --repo --json\\\\` (120s cap, process-group kill, 8MB output cap), filters entities to the session's own files, and applies a new \\\\`SessionEntityDeltas\\\\` backfill write request (modelled on \\\\`BackfillAttribution\\\\`, implemented for all four store backends).\\n- The ref advance is **CAS + bounded retry** (re-reads tip, rebuilds on the new parent) so a backfill can never orphan a concurrent condense's checkpoint; the OPF pre-push rewrite takes the entity-deltas lock for its duration so a late child parks instead of aborting a push.\\n- Backfill errors are logged and dropped — structurally unable to fail checkpoint creation.\\n\\n**Verification:** race and rewrite interactions covered by deterministic tests (\\\\`TestBackfillEntityDeltas_TipMovedUnderTheWrite_KeepsBothCheckpoints\\\\`, \\\\`REDACTED\\\\`, both mutation-verified — reverting the CAS or the rewrite lock fails them with the real failure). Producer fixture captured verbatim from a real \\\\`entire-graph\\\\` build (commit noted in the fixture). \\\\`mise run check\\\\` green (lint 0, unit+integration, canary e2e 4/4).\\\" 2>&1 | tail -2\",\"description\":\"Push cli branch and open PR\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":23},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4b6f2a0b-1bd5-4237-96b7-fe8a2f975da7","timestamp":"2026-08-18T21:10:43.148Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-keystone","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
