{"parentUuid":"b06eac02-eba8-43c6-92bb-efc70490c684","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAuE2vh3Zc11vfNNZUeV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01346kN8iYypucysVXgE7CqL","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-keystone && git push -u origin feat/entity-checkpoint-index -q && gh pr create --repo entireio/entire-brain --base main --head feat/entity-checkpoint-index --title \"Entity → checkpoint index: git-native history for code entities (keystone)\" --body \"The VCS-keystone core (COR-783 + COR-784): the brain can now answer **\\\"which checkpoints/sessions changed entity X\\\"** from a persisted git-native index instead of re-parsing history.\n\n**What's here (3 commits):**\n1. \\`factgitmeta\\`: a shared local git-meta record store (same lockfile + ref discipline as the facts head; the latent nested-flock hazard is documented, Backend deliberately untouched).\n2. \\`internal/entityindex\\`: builds per-checkpoint entity deltas by running \\`entire graph diff\\` per commit (first-parent), stores them under git-meta — forward \\`brain:entities\\` doc per commit, reverse \\`brain:entity:<hex(path#kind#name)>\\` commit lists, rename/move aliases — plus a derived, rebuildable query cache. Coverage is tracked as a **contiguous indexed window** {floor, tip}: ticks extend tip forward (O(new commits)), backfill converges floor backward in bounded chunks; \\`--checkpoints-only\\` never moves cursors.\n3. CLI + surfaces: \\`entire brain entities backfill|history|show\\`, MCP tool \\`brain_entity_history\\`, freshness wired into the watch tick and session-end hook (lock-first TryLock — contention skips the tick without doing work), and distill now anchors facts to the same-session checkpoint that actually changed the locus entity (deterministic tie-breaks; \\`entire brain verify\\` taught to accept sharpened anchors while remaining byte-identical for every existing latest-checkpoint anchor).\n\n**Contract:** delta doc schema_version 1.0, shared with entireio/cli's checkpoint \\`entity_deltas.json\\` (entireio/cli PR #2041) and produced from entireio/entire-graph diff output (entire-graph PR #114); tolerates old producers without \\`schema_version\\`/\\`producer_version\\`.\n\n**Verification:** two adversarial review rounds; 10 mutation checks across the campaign (reverse-index write, provenance fallback, cache tip-pin, cursor-poisoning, cache-persist-on-git-error, lock ordering, tie-break, verify row selection, walk budget, head-stall anchor) — each reverted mutation fails its test. Live e2e (\\`TestLiveEntityIndexBackfillAndHistory\\`) runs a real repo + real \\`entire graph\\` binary, not skipped. Full suite 2,475 tests green; gofmt/vet/lint clean.\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Push brain branch and open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1293,"cache_read_input_tokens":210025,"output_tokens":1045,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1293,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1045,"cache_read_input_tokens":210025,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1293,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1293},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAuDyeVVXVgjRV6qApdm","type":"assistant","uuid":"78a2a458-d5aa-49d9-802b-30d878bec644","timestamp":"2026-08-18T21:11:23.444Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/cli-keystone","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing