e).\n- entireio/cli #2041 — gated (default OFF) entity_deltas.json per checkpoint session dir; detached\n  `entire __entity_deltas` backfill child; CAS+retry ref advance; OPF rewrite takes the deltas lock.\n- entireio/entire-brain #87 — internal/entityindex; contiguous {floor,tip} window cursors;\n  entities backfill|history|show; MCP brain_entity_history; verify-compatible same-session provenance\n  sharpening with deterministic tie-breaks.\nHardened by 2 adversarial rounds (round-1 verdicts: cli+brain NO-SHIP, both fixed); 10+ mutations all\nkilled; live e2e ran real binary. COR-785 (transparency-log causality) DEFERRED to platform post-P1.\nWorktrees: graph-keystone/, cli-keystone/, p0p1/brain-keystone. Linear COR-781..784 still Canceled —\nneed reactivation. Related: [[p0-p1-completion-worktrees]], [[git-meta-strategic-context]].\nEOF\nprintf -- '- [Keystone 3 PRs open](keystone-3-prs-open.md) — graph #114 + cli #2041 + brain #87 wire-compatible, 2 adversarial rounds, awaiting review\\n' >> /Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/MEMORY.md\necho ok","description":"Record shipped keystone PRs in notepad and memory"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":298,"cache_read_input_tokens":212554,"output_tokens":1318,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":298,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1318,"cache_read_input_tokens":212554,"cache_creation_input_tokens":298,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":298},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAuFtRmnRYsJJ1cHYoc4","type":"assistant","uuid":"466edd7b-8fb8-49b1-a53e-4700a558ee22","timestamp":"20