{"parentUuid":"5b0954d0-228d-4420-a5f0-8b8a996294d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAyzACgYUnrrQjQhjgaf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Not 300 — **full LoCoMo as we run it is ~1,540 scored questions** (10 conversations, adversarial category 5 dropped, mem0-comparable protocol). That's the \"full n\" in our ledger.\n\nAnd there's a scar specifically about this: our paired delta was **+2.00 at n=400 and fell to −0.39 at the full 1,540** — a 300-question slice can show you a win that doesn't exist. Never quote a LoCoMo number before full n.\n\nCost for one arm, full run, gpt-5.6 answerer:\n\n- Ingest: **$0** (deterministic, ~7s)\n- Answering: 1,540 questions × few-k tokens ≈ **$8–15**\n- LLM judge pass: **~$3–5**\n\n**Total: roughly $15–25 for the full single-arm LoCoMo.** Cheap enough to run the whole thing every time — there's no reason to ever run a subset."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42,"cache_read_input_tokens":224733,"output_tokens":1139,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":830},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1139,"cache_read_input_tokens":224733,"cache_creation_input_tokens":42,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":42},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAyz6Go568HeCn4ANV9r","type":"assistant","uuid":"6c6a5794-8bcf-41a6-9929-09f77cc68a3f","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:13:53.200Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-keystone","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","vers