{"parentUuid":"026177ee-35d7-484e-a834-cf28309bacc5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAz7jrSfYPgYV1M5ifGt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_read_input_tokens":224775,"output_tokens":1019,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":611},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1173,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1019,"cache_read_input_tokens":224775,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1173},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAz7eQGtr9EfYLoDZQJi","type":"assistant","uuid":"4d5816af-2358-49d9-959c-dff081d7567a","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:15:28.907Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-keystone","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"4d5816af-2358-49d9-959c-dff081d7567a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeAz7jrSfYPgYV1M5ifGt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Full two-arm comparison (brain vs mem0) on full LoCoMo, gpt-5.6 answerer both sides:\n\n| | Brain arm | mem0 arm |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ingest | $0 (~7s, deterministic) | **~$10–30** in LLM calls (and ~14h wall-clock) |\n| Answering (1,540 Q) | $8–15 | $8–15 |\n| Judge | $3–5 | $3–5 |\n\n**Total: ~$40–75 for the full head-to-head** — and notably the *comparison itself demonstrates the pitch*: mem0's arm costs 2–3× more and takes ~14 hours before it can answer a single question, while our arm is answering within seconds of ingest. Worth capturing those two numbers as results, not overhead.\n\nExtra arms are cheap if you want the fuller table: each additional deterministic-ingest arm (cmm, graphify) adds only ~$15–25, since they share the free-ingest property.\n\nOne fairness note from the ledger: identical answerer model, identical judge, identical question set both arms, and top-k equalizes *items not context* — mem0 packs more context per item, so report context-chars alongside scores or reviewers will call it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_read_input_tokens":224775,"output_tokens":1019,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":611},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1173,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1019,"cache_read_input_tokens":224775,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1173,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1173},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeAz7eQGtr9EfYLoDZQJi","type":"assistan