{"parentUuid":"8873bc8a-75c2-410b-967d-41a546a24336","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeB1mt8ShvosXPYTXWRhw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirmed, exactly:\n\n- **Only the brain arm** — `--backend entire`, nothing else runs (no mem0, no other arms).\n- **Answerer: `gpt-5.6-terra`** via the Azure endpoint.\n- **Everything else byte-identical to the prior eg protocol** (`gpt5_run.sh`): `--provider azure_ai`, `--top-k-cutoffs 200`, `LLM_MAX_COMPLETION_FLOOR=16000`, same `entire-graph` binary, fresh deterministic corpus build, smoke-then-guard-then-full sequence, full ~1,540 questions.\n\nOne deliberate choice to flag: **judge stays `gpt-5`** (as in the prior run) rather than terra. That keeps the score directly comparable to the existing table (eg 94.74 / mem0 93.83 were judged by gpt-5) and isolates the one variable you're testing — the answerer model. If you want judge=terra instead, say so and I'll restart — cheap to redo, but you'd lose apples-to-apples with the old numbers.\n\nSmoke phase is running now; monitor pings me every 10 minutes."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_read_input_tokens":252316,"output_tokens":807,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":418},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":807,"cache_read_input_tokens":252316,"cache_creation_input_tokens":46,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":46},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeB1mpySNmTU1VCSXpc7k","type":"assistant","uuid":"06fbc68f-22f4-4be5-9bf5-63b5005ccc2f","timestamp":"2026-08-18T22:37:13.915Z","effort":"xhigh","session_