{"parentUuid":"e996801b-221c-4ef7-9de1-9f6a332cca7e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeB5FxWW5iBPDtzzDLvGD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Harness explorer is back with load-bearing facts: the live harness is `graphmark/agentic-swebench` (not the old path), it's hard-wired to one session per instance (a phase loop `s1/`/`s2/` is new work), but the expensive machinery — checkout/locking, netjail isolation, prompt-symmetry gate, the gate/bootstrap/paired-stats stack, Docker grading — is all reusable. And instance JSONs carry patch file-paths, so **A→B pairs can be mined offline for free** (same repo + overlapping touched files, temporally ordered).\n\nWaiting on the brain-surfaces explorer before the design pass — the make-or-break question it answers: can distill ingest a raw Claude Code transcript directly (simple harness), or does it need `entire` CLI capture wrapping the session (heavier)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3694,"cache_read_input_tokens":300634,"output_tokens":1328,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1050},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3694,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1328,"cache_read_input_tokens":300634,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3694,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3694},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeB5Fu39fjigrzJjpB1ox","type":"assistant","uuid":"21d728d8-aa97-4245-8e1a-11f682c67f54","timestamp":"2026-08-18T23:23:06.011Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/graph-keystone","sessionId":"de2