{"parentUuid":"71b21d25-7bec-45bc-b5bc-c53f7819423a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeB7Fgjhi9LYBx3QtS4Nz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**BrainMark build is underway.** Status across everything live:\n\n- **BrainMark $0 stage**: Opus builder constructing the full harness in `p0p1/brainmark` — miner, seal + pre-registration, all 6 arms' memory sources, symmetry-gated prompts, mechanism metrics, vendored stats, offline tests with mutation checks. Crucially it **runs the pair miner for real** against the graphmark task pool, so its report leads with the candidate count — the go/no-go for n≥30. Paid tiers (null test ~$15 → Sonnet pilot ~$60–120 → full run) wait for your explicit go at each step.\n- **LoCoMo final table** (all full n=1,540, audited): base config — terra 90.84 vs gpt-5 90.39; **chrono config — sol 92.99 vs terra 91.90**. On the brain's best configuration, sol remains the stronger answerer by ~1.1pt.\n- Keystone PRs (#114 draft, #2041, #87) still open awaiting review; notepad and memory updated with all of tonight's state.\n\nI'll report when the builder lands with the miner counts."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":611,"cache_read_input_tokens":337686,"output_tokens":382,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":611,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":382,"cache_read_input_tokens":337686,"cache_creation_input_tokens":611,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":611},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeB7FdNJJfkTaYL8mVYEa","type":"assistant","uuid":"e68edc7b-041f-4f1c-8ca4-d944d6b1725b","timestamp