{"parentUuid":"c6647541-062a-4b7b-be03-10e628283c4e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeB7nJFDi2La5aZs6wWB9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WPMGK5Wmz8i9FUfG4kzkgB","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/.claude/plans && python3 - <<'EOF'\nimport re\np = 'quizzical-sniffing-quasar.md'\ns = open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\"**all comp arms** (mem0 + Graphify + cmm + raw_history ablation)\",\n              \"**all comp arms** (mem0 + Graphify + cmm; NO ablation arms — one true brain arm only, user 2026-08-19)\")\ns = s.replace(\"`memsources/{empty,raw_history,full_brain,mem0_source,graphify_source,cmm_source}.py`\",\n              \"`memsources/{empty,full_brain,mem0_source,graphify_source,cmm_source}.py`\")\ns = s.replace(\"  - `raw_history`: A transcript verbatim, tail-truncated to max_bytes — distillation ablation.\\n\", \"\")\ns = s.replace(\"full_brain vs no_brain (headline), vs raw_history\\n  (distillation value), vs mem0/graphify/cmm (competitor table)\",\n              \"full_brain vs no_brain (headline), vs mem0/graphify/cmm (competitor table)\")\ns = s.replace(\"| raw_history | raw A transcript | distillation > transcript-dumping |\\n\", \"\")\ns = s.replace(\"| full_brain | distill+history over pinned A JSONL | the product |\",\n              \"| full_brain | distill+history over pinned A JSONL | the product (the ONLY brain arm) |\")\ns = s.replace(\"30 A + 180 B\", \"30 A + 150 B (5 arms)\").replace(\"10 A + 60 B\", \"10 A + 50 B\")\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('raw_history mentions left:', s.count('raw_history'))\nEOF","description":"Remove raw_history arm from plan file"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":353,"cache_read_input_tokens":342511,"output_tokens":667,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":353,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":342511,"cache_creation_input_tokens":353,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":353},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeB7nETGNMBdM2vDca93T","type":"assistant","uuid":"21405fe9-a598-4257-b5cc-970a07e3244c","timestamp":"2026-08-18T23:55:55.889Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"21405fe9-a598-4257-b5cc-970a07e3244c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5e9abcc5-a278-4c01-b1bc-3ac5ee870475","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WPMGK5Wmz8i9FUfG4kzkgB","type":"tool_result","content":"raw_history mentions left: 0\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"36f1ffdf-a6aa-4275-81b6-da0b470a9bf4","timestamp":"2026-08-18T23:55:55.942Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"raw_history mentions left: 0","stderr":"\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/suhaan/devenv","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"21405fe9-a598-4257-b5cc-970a07e3244c","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"36f1ffdf-a6aa-4275-81b6-da0b470a9bf4","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/plans/quizzical-sniffing-quasar.md","snippet":"1\t# BrainMark — flagship benchmark for entire-brain (fair, all-competitor, publication-grade)\n2\t\n3\t## Context\n4\t\n5\tLoCoMo/LME only measure the brain's retrieval substrate over chat transcripts (tonight's runs:\n6\tbase terra 90.84, chrono sol 92.99, chrono terra 91.90 — engine credibility, not product proof).\n7\tThe product claim — **\"a second coding session reuses what the first learned\"** — has never been\n8\tmeasured. BrainMark is that measurement: agent does task A, memory is derived from A's session,\n9\tagent does related task B with memory vs without vs competitors. Built to survive publication\n10\treview (user is thinking NeurIPS-class venues): pre-registered primary metric, sealed tasks,\n11\texternal tasks + external grading, released harness.\n12\t\n13\tUser decisions: **all comp arms** (mem0 + Graphify + cmm; NO ablation arms — one true brain arm only, user 2026-08-19) ·\n14\t**SWE-bench mined pairs** as task source · **pilot → full** budget path.\n15\t\n16\t## Architecture\n17\t\n18\tNew thin orchestrator **`benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark/`** (in the entire-brain repo,\n19\tbranch off main / on top of keystone), importing the existing `run.py` **as a library**\n20\t(it has a `__main__` guard at run.py:11130 — do not modify it) for its fairness primitives:\n21\tpacket bounding (:4731/:5014), delimiter guard (:4840), arm-neutral policy text (:6724),\n22\tsealed-bundle schema (:3923), env sanitization (:5108), sandbox-exec (:5124), pinned distill\n23\tdriver (:4578). GraphMark (`/Users/suhaan/devenv/graphmark/agentic-swebench`) supplies the\n24\tSWE-bench side as patterns/data, not a framework: task JSONs, repo-cache worktrees+locks\n25\t(run_3arm.sh:54-89), netjail, Docker grading (tools/grade_tag.sh), and vendored paired stats\n26\t(tools/metrics.py — log-ratios, geo-mean, median, 20k bootstrap CI, McNemar, session gates).\n27\t\n28\t## Components (new files under `benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark/`)\n29\t\n30\t- `config.json` — graphmark root, repo-cache, model tiers, packet max_bytes, per-competitor\n31\t  pins (mem0 version/embedder; graphify + cmm pinned binaries), distill pin, concurrency=8, seeds.\n32\t- `mine_pairs.py` — offline $0 miner (below) → `candidates/*.json`.\n33\t- `seal.py` + `PREREGISTRATION.md` — human-review promotion to `tasks/sealed/` (n≥30) +\n34\t  disjoint 10-pair dev split; `SEAL-MANIFEST.json` = sha256 of every task + miner commit +\n35\t  prereg hash. Report refuses to aggregate on hash mismatch. Seal BEFORE first confirmatory run.\n36\t- `session_a.py` — session A runs ONCE per pair per tier (`claude -p` stream-JSON, isolated\n37\t  CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR); native claude-code JSONL harvested and sha256-pinned. Shared by ALL arms.\n38\t- `memsources/{empty,full_brain,mem0_source,graphify_source,cmm_source}.py` — each:\n39\t  pinned-A-bytes in → memory packet out, bounded/guarded by run.py primitives; the PACKET is\n40\t  sha256-pinned (not the store), so ingest nondeterminism can't create arm asymmetry.\n41\t  - `full_brain`: write A transcript to `<brainDir>/sessions/main/<id>.jsonl` + synthesized\n42\t    manifest (contract proven in internal/cli/distill_cmd_test.go:25-75) → pinned\n43\t    `entire-brain distill` + `refresh history` → ONE frozen `brain search/brief --json`,\n44\t    query = B's problem_statement.\n45\t  - `mem0/graphify/cmm`: same A bytes into each competitor (duck-typed add/search clients —\n46\t    mirror /Users/suhaan/devenv/eg-memharness/bench/memory/benchmarks/common/entire_client.py;\n47\t    graphify+cmm clients exist there to adapt), retrieval with the SAME query string and byte\n48\t    budget, rendered into the IDENTICAL envelope. Prep cost recorded separately, reported.\n49\t- `prompts.py` — one scaffold for all 6 arms; packet block present in every arm (no_brain gets\n50\t  a fixed \"(no prior-session memory available)\" sentinel); symmetry gate = sha256 of prompt\n51\t  with packet region replaced by `<PACKET>` must be identical across a pair's arms; enforced\n52\t  at launch and re-checked at report time.\n53\t- `run_b.py` — B driver: worktree at base_commit_B (graphmark lock pattern), netjail, run.py\n54\t  env-sanitization + sandbox, `claude -p` stream-JSON safe mode; per-cell results dir with\n55\t  cc_out.json, stream.jsonl, patch.diff, packet.sha256, prompt_sym.sha256; idempotent resume\n56\t  (skip iff usd>0 ∧ patch nonempty).\n57\t- `mechmetrics.py` — PRIMARY pre-registered metric: `locate_calls_pre_edit` = tool_use in\n58\t  {Read,Grep,Glob} ∪ {Bash matching ^(rg|grep|egrep|git grep|find|ls|cat|head|tail|ag)\\b}\n59\t  strictly before first {Edit,Write,MultiEdit,NotebookEdit}; no-edit sessions counted whole +\n60\t  flagged; ratios on (count+1). Secondary: tokens/usd (modelUsage), duration, num_turns.\n61\t- `grade.py` — wraps graphmark grade_tag.sh (Docker swebench.harness.run_evaluation); B graded\n62\t  by its own FAIL_TO_PASS. `vendor/graphmark_metrics.py` — pinned metrics.py copy w/ provenance\n63\t  header. `report.py` — REPORT.md/json: full_brain vs no_brain (headline), vs mem0/graphify/cmm (competitor table).\n64\t\n65\t## Pair mining (deterministic, $0)\n66\t\n67\tGroup graphmark `tasks/*.json` instances by repo, sort by created_at; for ordered (A,B):\n68\t≥1 overlapping file between patch_A and patch_B (diff --git paths) · `git merge-base\n69\t--is-ancestor base_A base_B` · score = Jaccard(files) + hunk-header symbol overlap (optional\n70\t`entire graph diff` entity rerank when available) · leakage screens: patch-body token overlap\n71\t< 0.8 (A must not BE B's fix), borderline flagged for seal review · one best A per B ·\n72\temit ≥40 candidates with full provenance.\n73\t\n74\t## Arm matrix (session A once per pair, pinned, shared by all arms)\n75\t\n76\t| arm | memory source | proves |\n77\t|---|---|---|\n78\t| no_brain | sentinel-empty packet | baseline |\n79\t| full_brain | distill+history over pinned A JSONL | the product (the ONLY brain arm) |\n80\t| mem0 | mem0 OSS over same bytes | vs the named competitor |\n81\t| graphify | graphify over same bytes | vs YC code-memory competitor |\n82\t| cmm | cmm over same bytes | vs codebase-memory-mcp |\n83\t\n84\tAll packets harness-delivered through one envelope (phase0b doctrine — self-retrieval arms\n85\tdeferred to v2 exploratory).\n86\t\n87\t## Gates (all vendored/enforced)\n88\t\n89\tPer-session usd>0 ∧ patch nonempty · all-arms-clean pair gate, symmetric drops · prompt-symmetry\n90\tsha equal · packet sha matches pin · no Entire-family tools outside full_brain · no\n91\t.entire/.benchmark/checkpoint-ref inspection anywhere (run.py audit) · no A-artifact paths\n92\treadable from B worktree.\n93\t\n94\t## Runbook + cost (6 arms)\n95\t\n96\t1. **$0**: mine → human seal (n≥30 + 10 dev) → prereg freeze → symmetry/pinning/miner-determinism\n97\t   unit tests.\n98\t2. **Null test (~$15, non-negotiable)**: 3 dev pairs × 2 reps, full_brain machinery with EMPTY\n99\t   packet vs no_brain — primary + token deltas must straddle 0. Proves the machinery is inert.\n100\t3. **Pilot (Sonnet, 10 dev pairs)**: 10 A + 50 B + prep ≈ **$60–120**. Fix harness only, never tasks.\n101\t4. **Full (n≥30 sealed, main model)**: 30 A + 150 B (5 arms) ≈ **$700–1,500 on Opus** (or ~$150–300 on\n102\t   gpt-5.6-class via Azure if the user prefers). Concurrency 8, resume-safe.\n103\t5. Docker grading (free) → `report.py`.\n104\t\n105\t## Verification\n106\t\n107\tMiner determinism (byte-identical double run) · seal-hash round-trip · symmetry sha across\n108\tstub-packet arms · delimiter-guard rejection test · packet re-derivation → identical sha ·\n109\tmechmetrics vs 3 hand-labeled stream fixtures · null test (above) · leakage audit (grep B\n110\ttranscripts for A instance_ids/paths; sandbox denials logged) · one-pair end-to-end smoke\n111\tincluding Docker grading — all BEFORE the full spend.\n112\t\n113\t## Critical reused files\n114\t\n115\t- brain-keystone `benchmarks/agent-brain/run.py` (library import; DO NOT modify)\n116\t- brain-keystone `benchmarks/agent-brain/CONDITIONS.md` (normative contract; extend, don't fork)\n117\t- graphmark `agentic-swebench/tools/metrics.py` (vendor), `run_3arm.sh` (patterns),\n118\t  `tools/grade_tag.sh` (grading), `tasks/*.json` (instance pool)\n119\t- brain-keystone `internal/cli/distill_cmd_test.go:25-75` (raw-JSONL ingest contract)\n\n... [1 lines truncated] ..."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"57058837-6f84-4295-8f6c-65ae24a98127","timestamp":"2026-08-18T23:55:55.949Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
