ovenance header).\n\n## TESTS — 55/55 pass, offline, $0\n\nMiner determinism (byte-identical ×2) · leakage + ancestry gates · seal round-trip + 4 tamper detections · report refusal (packet-sha, symmetry re-derived from `prompt.txt`) · symmetry across 5 arms · delimiter guard · packet re-derivation · mechmetrics vs 3 hand-labelled fixtures incl. no-edit · full `run_b` layout via PATH-stubbed `claude`. Stats path separately verified end-to-end on synthetic n=30 (bootstrap CI, LOO, McNemar all execute).\n\n## MUTATIONS — all 3 caught\n\n| break | test that failed |\n|---|---|\n| symmetry gate stops raising | `test_asymmetric_instructions_are_detected` |\n| instructions name memory source | `test_all_five_arms_share_one_symmetry_sha` (5 distinct shas) |\n| miner leakage cap removed | `test_identical_patches_are_rejected_as_leakage` |\n\nReverted; suite green; no MUTANT residue.\n\n## COMMITS\n`88694b3f` mining/seal/prompts/metrics · `17cebd8c` memsources/drivers/grade/report · `18f5e9f6` tests+docs. No AI footers. Not pushed.\n\n## NOTES\n- **Scope change applied**: 5 arms, no `raw_history` (none was written — nothing orphaned). DATASHEET.md + REPRODUCIBILITY.md added.\n- `run.py` imported as a library, **unmodified** (verified by diff); zero functions vendored from it.\n- **Corrected a plan assumption**: brain-dir discovery must use `status --json`, not `distill --dry-run --json` — the latter exits non-zero with \"no exported sessions\" on a cold brain, exactly the state at discovery time.\n- `full_brain` manifest synthesis is proven against the **real binary** (`sessions_to_distill == 1`), no paid distill.\n- `config.json` model names are placeholders — **pin them before sealing**, since the seal hashes the config.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>242424</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>95</tool_uses><duration_ms>1641871</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
