{"parentUuid":"b32714e5-eef8-47b6-8fbd-1aecdc5ed7bc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeB9PBhfR8muNYCbY9ux1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**BrainMark $0 stage: built and verified.** Summary of where things stand:\n\n- **Harness complete on `feat/brainmark`** (3 commits, not pushed): miner, seal + pre-registration + datasheet + reproducibility docs, all 5 arms' memory sources, symmetry-gated prompts, mechanism metrics, vendored stats, B-session driver, Docker grading wrapper. 55/55 offline tests, mutations caught (symmetry gate, arm-naming leak, leakage cap), `run.py` imported unmodified.\n- **The one blocker is data, not code**: 15 verified pairs vs the 30 minimum — because 22 repos with ~83 potential candidates weren't cloned locally for the ancestry check. A Sonnet agent is now adding partial clones (commit-graph only, additive to the shared repo-cache, announced in comms) and re-mining.\n- **Next gates after the count comes back**: pin the config models → human seal review of candidates → then the paid ladder needs your go at each rung: null test (~$15) → Sonnet pilot (~$60–120) → full n≥30.\n\nI'll report the new candidate count when the re-mine finishes."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1073,"cache_read_input_tokens":353670,"output_tokens":396,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1073,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":396,"cache_read_input_tokens":353670,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1073,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1073},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeB9P61MqE7RcNnNLu4kU","type