omputing from tokens × config prices in agents/backends.json).\n2. (0.5) mechmetrics.py backend-neutral: map codex stream tool events into the LOCATE/EDIT taxonomy; add ≥2 hand-labeled codex-stream fixtures (mirror the claude fixtures' style); the metric definition doc-comment must state the per-backend mapping precisely.\n3. (0.4) memsources/irrelevant.py: placebo packet = a DIFFERENT pair's session-A-derived packet (deterministic derangement over the sealed pair list, same-repo excluded), same byte budget, same envelope. Register the 6th arm everywhere arms are enumerated (prompts.py etc.); extend the symmetry test to 6 arms.\n4. (0.6) run_b.py --rep N with per-rep seed in the results path (results/<tag>/<arm>/<pair>/rep<k>/), resume-safe per rep. power_analysis.py: reads pilot report JSON → per-pair log-ratio variance → MDE curve + smallest n for 80% power at 15% locate-call reduction (pre-committed rule from the plan) + pair/arm/rep variance decomposition; pure stdlib; unit-tested on synthetic data with known answer.\n5. Dry-run proof: run_b full layout via a PATH-stubbed codex binary (like the existing claude stub test) — no paid calls.\nMUTATION-verify: (a) break the codex locate-call mapping → codex fixture test fails; (b) break the derangement (allow same-pair packet) → irrelevant-arm test fails. State results.\nReport caveman-ultra: files+lines, adapter contract summary, fixture/mutation results, test totals. Max 18 lines."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6740,"cache_read_input_tokens":382437,"output_tokens":6151,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1303},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6740,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":6151,"cache_read_input_token