{"parentUuid":"1eb9f241-54c1-4c01-99f9-5d260b8403b7","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14958507 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1c79538c-616d-479a-9191-3c5b315014ff","timestamp":"2026-08-19T01:40:30.332Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"1c79538c-616d-479a-9191-3c5b315014ff","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeBFmRzxKtsGWtX2PQWQe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Phase 0 is building.** The answer to your original question, compressed: not NeurIPS-level as it stood — four accept-blockers (scale, contamination, single backend, artifact compliance) — and the approved Part-2 plan closes every engineerable one. Three builders are now running in parallel on partitioned files:\n\n- **Data**: full SWE-bench + Verified + Multilingual mining (target ≥300 candidate pairs, up from 83), blob-less repo clones, the fresh post-cutoff PR miner (your contamination-killer split), competitor version pins.\n- **Runner**: Azure GPT adapters with codex as primary (gpt-5 / 5.6-sol / 5.6-terra), backend-neutral mechanism metric with codex fixtures, the placebo-memory 6th arm, reps + power analysis.\n- **Protocol**: dual-rater seal with Cohen's kappa (you + a teammate as raters), construct-validity labeling protocol, pre-registration amendments (contamination argument, power rule, validity gate), the anonymized release builder + Croissant/RAI generator (the 2026+ desk-reject items), and the paper outline.\n\nWhat honesty requires me to keep saying: nobody can engineer 100% acceptance — the residual risks are written into the plan and will go in the paper's limitations rather than be hidden. What we *can* control is that no reviewer finds a rigor gap we didn't find first.\n\nNext after the builders report: verification pass → commits → Phase 1 (mine at full scale + your seal review session with a teammate). The paid ladder (null test $15 → pilot $60–120 → confirmatory ~$700–1,500 all-GPT) still stops for your go at each rung."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":663,"cache_read_input_tokens":396676,"output_tokens":571,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking