{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-19T02:02:22.726Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a2a2b2046e91d20ac</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_016KY6ZjAAVcFTLto6nQPVWW</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/a2a2b2046e91d20ac.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Build full-pool + fresh miners\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Done. Final report:\n\n**LEAD: verified candidates = 1806** (pool mode, all gates unchanged, 0 unverifiable) · **82** in local-JSON mode (was 15; repo-cache was the binding constraint, now filled). Target ≥300 exceeded 6×.\n\n**Files** (all under `/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark/`): `pool_loaders.py` 450 · `clone_repos.py` 370 · `mine_fresh.py` 552 · `COMPETITORS.md` 306 · `mine_pairs.py` 612 (refactor: `mine_pool()` now shared verbatim with the fresh miner; `--pool/--all-pools`; `write_candidates(preserve=)`) · `config.json` 183 (+`pools`/`clone`/`fresh` blocks, competitor pins) · tests 386+251+400.\n\n**HF pools DOWNLOADED** (126 MB upstream ≪ 10 GB cap → no deferral needed; system python3 lacks `datasets`, used `/Library/Frameworks/Python.framework/Versions/3.12/bin/python3`): Verified 500 @`c104f840`, Multilingual 300 @`846e647b` (mit), SWE-bench test 2294 @`e48e2bd1`. 57 MB normalized JSON in `pools/`. Revision shas verified end-to-end into `candidates/INDEX.json`. **Multimodal SKIPPED** — HF card declares no license; registry entry `enabled:false` with reason.\n\n**Clone ledger** (`pools/CLONE-LEDGER.json`): 53 repos known, **51 ok, 0 failed**, 2 below-min-instances. 24 cloned this run `--filter=blob:none`, +2.8 GB (cache 4.4 GB, 94 GB free). Pre-existing clones detected and skipped, no re-attempts.\n\n**Fresh miner**: live smoke on 2 repos — 12 PRs → 2 instances (rejects: 7 no_linked_issue, 3 no_test_delta) → 1 pair, A-side historical. Full snapshot deliberately NOT frozen (that's the prereg determinism boundary; `--snapshot-only` freezes it).\n\n**Competitor pins** — independently re-verified, none invented: graphify `9f25a3aa` (public v8), cmm v0.9.0 @`b637e333` + patch sha256 `df139f26…` (re-hashed live), mem0 `4debc58a`. Still null: cmm **binary** sha256 (no local artifact) and mem0 **embedder** (code default, unobserved) — both have step-by-step resolution procedures in COMPETITORS.md instead of a fabricated value.\n\n**Tests**: 52 new, all offline, all pass. Full suite 205 ran, **1 error not mine**: `test_irrelevant_placebo` → `memsources/irrelevant.py:196` raises \"search response metadata exceeds the packet byte budget\" (another agent's in-flight placebo arm; independent of my changes).\n\n**Flags for you** (files I was not allowed to touch): (1) `pools/` 57 MB is **not gitignored** — `.gitignore` needs `pools/*.json` + `!pools/CLONE-LEDGER.json`; (2) `README.md` still says 15 candidates / 22 missing repos — now 82 / 0; (3) fresh-split mining needs `git fetch` across the repo-cache first, or stale clones drop recent PRs as `unverifiable_ancestry` (5 of 6 in the smoke). Nothing committed; all changes left in the working tree.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>204646</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>88</tool_uses><duration_ms>1359963</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
