implements both, tested). cc_out synthesized claude-shaped\n      so report.py/grade.py read a codex cell unchanged (verified: report.collect on rep0 -&gt; clean). Token\n      parse reuses run.py:7379 via harness() (`via: run.py:extract_usage`). No MCP flags for any arm.\nMECHMETRICS backend auto-detected; codex map documented exactly: command_execution/local_shell_call-&gt;Bash\n     (bash -lc unwrapped, frozen allowlist), file_change/patch_apply-&gt;EDIT, mcp/web-&gt;other, reasoning/\n     agent_message not calls; item.started+item.completed collapse IN PLACE; legacy msg.* schema supported.\n     Frozen primary unchanged (`sed -n` etc. -&gt; new SECONDARY locate_calls_pre_edit_extended, prereg-safe).\nPLACEBO donor = deterministic derangement (group by repo, order by -size, shift by largest group) -&gt; no fixed\n     point, no same-repo, order-independent; refuses if one repo &gt; n/2. Packet = donor's full_brain results +\n     THIS pair's query, same envelope, size-matched to treatment bytes; empty/own/malformed donor = hard error.\n     6th arm registered in prompts.ARMS (not memsources.ARMS - its signature needs a donor); 6-arm sha equal.\nREPS run_b --rep N / --rep-index k -&gt; `&lt;out&gt;/rep&lt;k&gt;/&lt;pair&gt;/&lt;arm&gt;/`, rep ABOVE pair so each rep root is a valid\n     report.py/grade.py root; no --rep = legacy layout untouched. rep_seed=master*1000+k in meta (documented:\n     no backend exposes a sampling seed). Resume guard now backend-aware (codex usd is estimated -&gt; gate on\n     complete usage + output_tokens&gt;0, else every codex cell re-ran forever).\nPOWER pure stdlib: log-ratio sd -&gt; required_n (hand-checked: sd .5 -&gt; n_exact 74.2916 -&gt; n 75, +2 t-corr),\n     MDE curve, achieved_power, sealed cap flags UNDERPOWERED, pair/arm/rep variance components (balanced EMS,\n     unbalanced refused, negatives clamped+flagged), sd_by_reps/required_n_by_reps.\nDRY-RUN PATH-stubbed `codex` -&gt; run_b rep0+rep1 full layout (9 files/cell), synthesized cc_out usd&gt;0,\n     mechmetrics locate_pre_edit=2, patch collected, resume skips rep1 / runs rep2, key absent from meta.\nMUTATIONS all caught: (a) drop bash -lc unwrap -&gt; 3 fail; drop item dedup -&gt; 3 fail (5!=3, 11!=9); empty\n     CODEX_EDIT_ITEMS -&gt; 3 fail. (b) shift 0 -&gt; 4 fail (own packet); shift 1 -&gt; 2 fail (same-repo);\n     drop donor==recipient guard -&gt; 1 fail. All reverted, files byte-identical.\nTESTS 268 passed (126 pre-existing, +142 new). No commits.\nACTION FOR config.json OWNER (I did not touch it): add \"irrelevant\" to arms, \"agent.backend\":\"codex\", and\n     \"session_b.codex_tier_pilot/full\" (plain tier_* keys stay claude-only by design; codex otherwise falls\n     back to backends.json roles primary=gpt-5.6-sol / generality=gpt-5.6-terra). Placebo needs --pairs and\n     requires the donor's full_brain cell to exist first (loud error otherwise). Azure prices are placeholders.\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>278047</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>103</tool_uses><duration_ms>1891517</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"3869fff9-8546-4a58-9f64-3128ad9f2014","timestamp":"2026-08-19T02:11:31.170Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
