{"parentUuid":"d5cc02d3-c812-45d1-b2ac-3b6673029d83","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeBJMzvJ2v8Fr3i52UkCn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Phase 0 is complete and committed** — 7 commits on `feat/brainmark`, ~10.5K lines added this phase, 268 tests + 57 subtests green, working tree clean.\n\nWhat BrainMark now is, in NeurIPS terms:\n\n| Accept-blocker | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Scale | **Closed**: 1,806 verified candidate pairs (6× the target) from SWE-bench + Verified + Multilingual with pinned HF revisions; unlicensed Multimodal pool correctly excluded |\n| Contamination | **Machinery built**: fresh post-cutoff PR miner smoke-tested, paired-design argument + floor-compression check pre-registered as dated amendments |\n| Generality | **Closed for v1**: Azure GPT adapter (gpt-5 / 5.6-sol / 5.6-terra) as primary backend with backend-neutral mechanism metrics; claude adapter retained |\n| Artifact compliance | **Built**: anonymizer with a live grep-gate (it currently flags 835 hits on the raw tree — proof it works), Croissant + RAI generator, maintenance policy, paper outline |\n\nPlus the scientific upgrades: placebo-memory control arm, dual-rater seal with Cohen's kappa enforced at promotion, construct-validity labeling protocol, and a power-analysis rule frozen before any confirmatory spend.\n\n**What's next needs humans and then money, in that order:**\n1. **Phase 1 (free, needs you)**: run the full-scale mine, then the seal review — you + a teammate rating candidates (~10–15h each at full scale; the protocol and criteria docs are written).\n2. **Null test (~$15)** → **pilot (~$60–120)** → confirmatory — each rung waits for your go.\n\nNothing pushed anywhere; it's all local on the worktree. Say the word when you want the branch pushed/PR'd, or when you're ready to schedule the seal session."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":417387,"output_tokens":660,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":417387,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":410},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeBJMqtpZSJb2YNn26fmc","type":"assistant","uuid":"80c7ed63-bac2-403f-b51d-42376f2de76b","timestamp":"2026-08-19T02:14:45.176Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
