its platform on arm64 hosts and 404s (real Apple-Silicon gap, not a missing-image issue).\n\n4. **NULL-MODE: PASS.** 2 fake pairs × 6 arms, `force_empty_packet=True`: full layout every cell; `packet_sha256`/`prompt_sym.sha256` each collapse to 1 value/pair; `report.py --allow-unsealed` exits 0, 2/2 pairs pass gate, all deltas +0.00% (expected for null).\n\n5. **TEST SUITE: PASS.** 268 passed, 57 subtests, 0 failed, 13.1s.\n\nNo repo files touched; all writes under `scratchpad/brainmark-verify/`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>138109</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>58</tool_uses><duration_ms>541662</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
