{"parentUuid":"70525027-631c-4f30-bed4-0259aeb7db98","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCC833SyS4rQTNSDvNSS","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The verification sweep did its job — two real failures caught before they could become desk-rejects:\n\n1. **Anonymizer leaks**: the release *output* still carries 403 forbidden hits (identifier fragments, the manifest self-leaking unanonymized paths, plus false-positive floods from ordinary English \"entirely\" in the pools data).\n2. **Croissant generator has genuine schema bugs** (fields missing `source`/`value`, wrong `content_size` type) — and the no-mlcroissant fallback would have said OK. A false-OK trap, now exposed.\n\nAlso two passes that matter: **Docker grading works end-to-end** (gold patch → RESOLVED, with an Apple-Silicon platform-flag workaround worth documenting) and **null-mode is provably inert** (all deltas +0.00%). Dispatching the fix pass:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1441,"cache_read_input_tokens":425625,"output_tokens":2119,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":605},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1441,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2119,"cache_read_input_tokens":425625,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1441,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1441},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCC7xXqM4CV3X67BZuaC","type":"assistant","uuid":"fc9a4abd-98e6-41a4-b3e4-e346609472cb","timestamp":"2026-08-19T13:33:38.568Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId"