{"parentUuid":"3bdb3113-4914-413e-b20b-fa0e2ae078c8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCGow9L353RQHVmzarzq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018zrDYgwyetQ7Cu2H7acRPo","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git push -u origin feat/brainmark -q && gh pr create --repo entireio/entire-brain --base main --head feat/brainmark --title \"BrainMark: sealed cross-session memory benchmark (A→B pairs, 6 arms, NeurIPS-grade harness)\" --body \"The flagship product benchmark: does a second coding session reuse what the first learned? Agent does task A → memory derived from A's pinned session bytes → related task B runs with that memory vs without vs competitors, on sealed SWE-bench-mined pairs with external Docker grading.\n\n**Scale & data** — 1,806 verified candidate pairs mined from SWE-bench + Verified + Multilingual (pinned HF revisions; Multimodal excluded — no license), plus a **79-pair fresh post-cutoff split** (PR snapshot frozen + sha-pinned, byte-deterministic re-mine) as the contamination robustness set.\n\n**Arms (6)** — no_brain baseline · full_brain (the only brain arm: pinned distill + one frozen retrieval) · irrelevant-memory placebo control · mem0 · graphify · cmm — every arm fed session-A bytes through one identical, sha-pinned packet envelope; prompt-symmetry enforced by hash at launch and re-checked at report time.\n\n**Rigor** — pre-registered primary mechanism metric (locate_calls_pre_edit, backend-neutral with hand-labeled claude+codex fixtures); dual-rater seal with Cohen's kappa enforced at promotion; construct-validity labeling protocol; power-analysis rule frozen before confirmatory spend; append-only dated pre-registration amendments; null-test mode proven inert (+0.00% deltas in dry run).\n\n**Backends** — Azure GPT family primary (gpt-5 / 5.6-sol / 5.6-terra via codex adapter); claude adapter retained. Cost honesty: codex usd computed from tokens with estimated=true flag.\n\n**Publication artifacts** — anonymizer whose output passes its own grep-gate at 0 hits (raw tree flags 835 — the gate is live); Croissant JSON-LD + RAI metadata validating clean under real mlcroissant; datasheet, reproducibility (incl. arm64 grading workaround), maintenance policy, paper outline.\n\n**Verification** — 331 tests + 57 subtests green, offline; miner determinism byte-identical; Docker grading smoke: gold patch → RESOLVED; 8+ mutation checks across the campaign, each proven to fail its test when reverted.\n\n**What this PR does NOT include**: no paid runs. The ladder (null test → pilot → confirmatory) and the human seal session (350-pair slate + per-rater packets are ready in review/) are gated behind explicit go decisions.\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Push brainmark branch and open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":658,"cache_read_input_tokens":439663,"output_tokens":1030,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":658,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1030,"cache_read_input_tokens":439663,"cache_creation_input_tokens":658,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":658},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCGoqahymkAAcYP6NbjE","type":"assistant","uuid":"7b9f9119-5147-4f6d-9a9e-90af39fa948a","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:35:06.531Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
