ex adapter); claude adapter retained. Cost honesty: codex usd computed from tokens with estimated=true flag.\\n\\n**Publication artifacts** — anonymizer whose output passes its own grep-gate at 0 hits (raw tree flags 835 — the gate is live); Croissant JSON-LD + RAI metadata validating clean under real mlcroissant; datasheet, reproducibility (incl. arm64 grading workaround), maintenance policy, paper outline.\\n\\n**Verification** — 331 tests + 57 subtests green, offline; miner determinism byte-identical; Docker grading smoke: gold patch → RESOLVED; 8+ mutation checks across the campaign, each proven to fail its test when reverted.\\n\\n**What this PR does NOT include**: no paid runs. The ladder (null test → pilot → confirmatory) and the human seal session (350-pair slate + per-rater packets are ready in review/) are gated behind explicit go decisions.\\\" 2>&1 | tail -1\",\"description\":\"Push brainmark branch and open PR\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":15},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d6d13dbd-8399-429d-8c7e-4fab435841a9","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:35:06.548Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
