{"parentUuid":"9d5112d1-3998-4918-99a8-f5af43509b0b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCGuNF5ZsYPdsJerxFv1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Done — every free item is finished, and I've stopped at the money line as instructed.**\n\n**BrainMark is now [PR #88 on entireio/entire-brain](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/88)** — 10 commits, 331 tests green, nothing merged. Final state of the $0 work:\n\n- **Data**: 1,806 verified candidate pairs (pinned HF revisions, unlicensed pool excluded) + **79 fresh post-cutoff pairs** with the PR snapshot frozen and byte-deterministic — the contamination split at double the planned depth.\n- **Seal session is turnkey**: 350-pair slate with diversity caps, per-rater independent packets, merge tool, and a quickstart with a ~3.5–5.5h/rater plan that reaches 30 sealed + 10 dev.\n- **Publication compliance proven, not claimed**: the anonymizer's output passes its own gate at 0 hits, Croissant JSON-LD validates under real mlcroissant, Docker grading graded a gold patch RESOLVED end-to-end (Apple-Silicon workaround documented), and null-mode is demonstrably inert.\n\n**What's left needs you, in order:**\n1. **Seal session** (free, human): you + one teammate, packets in `review/`, instructions in `REVIEWING-QUICKSTART.md`.\n2. **Null test — ~$15** (first paid rung; needs your go)\n3. **Pilot on gpt-5.6-sol — ~$60–120**\n4. **Confirmatory — ~$700–1,500 all-GPT** (final n set by the power analysis from pilot variance)\n\nAlso still awaiting your decisions from earlier threads: merging keystone PRs #114/#2041/#87 and P1's #85/#242. Notepad and memory carry the full state — this session can die safely."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":219,"cache_read_input_tokens":442983,"output_tokens":619,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_searc