{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01V2Ld7oByJHzCPrgzdbD6ad","lastSequenceNum":0,"noHistoryBackfill":true,"ownerAccountUuid":"00b6ef77-2993-4ccf-a0c2-108181d81f1f","ownerOrganizationUuid":"15c59575-010f-483d-b3ad-83e0f09c6dba"}
{"parentUuid":"2d466a42-308d-45b1-9d4b-9e92aad54896","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCH99Zj4NtARN2HaSDjz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54,"cache_read_input_tokens":445478,"output_tokens":1860,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":892},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1860,"cache_read_input_tokens":445478,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCH94VNncJH6NLa4K55j","type":"assistant","uuid":"f1701bad-2a81-4aec-a7f5-de150822c44b","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:39:26.959Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"f1701bad-2a81-4aec-a7f5-de150822c44b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCH99Zj4NtARN2HaSDjz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two answers:\n\n## What the benchmark needs — and no, it does *not* need real Entire sessions\n\nThat was the key design move: **session A is generated by the benchmark itself.** The harness runs the agent on task A, and that agent's own raw transcript (claude/codex JSONL, sha-pinned) *is* the session. The brain ingests it through the raw-JSONL + synthesized-manifest path we proved against the real binary — no `entire` CLI capture, no checkpoints, no product install needed. Your earlier worry (\"we don't have entire sessions here\") is exactly what this architecture solved.\n\nFull requirements checklist:\n\n| Need | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Task pairs | ✅ 1,806 candidates + 79 fresh — **pending your seal session** (the packets are ready; ~4–5h you + teammate) |\n| Session-A transcripts | ✅ produced by the harness itself during the run |\n| entire-brain binary | ✅ built, drives distill + retrieval |\n| mem0 | ✅ pip client; its ingest makes LLM calls (~$1–3/pilot, recorded as prep cost) |\n| graphify + cmm | ⚠️ clients ready, but **2 pins unresolved** (cmm binary hash, mem0 embedder) — COMPETITORS.md has the procedures; needs ~30 min before the pilot |\n| Agent backends | ✅ codex + Azure creds (gpt-5 / 5.6-sol / 5.6-terra); claude adapter spare |\n| Grading | ✅ Docker works (gold patch → RESOLVED; arm64 workaround documented) |\n| Compute | ✅ this Mac at concurrency 8, or a VM |\n\n## What to run, in order\n\n1. **Seal session — free, needs you + a teammate.** The single biggest quality lever. `REVIEWING-QUICKSTART.md` has the 3.5–5.5h plan → 30 sealed + 10 dev pairs.\n2. **Null test — ~$15.** 3 dev pairs, empty packets: proves the machinery itself moves nothing. Non-negotiable before real money.\n3. **Pilot — ~$60–120** on gpt-5.6-sol: 10 dev pairs × 6 arms × 2 reps. This is the decision point — it feeds the power analysis (fixes final n), the validity-labeling sample, and tells us whether an effect exists at all.\n4. **Second-model smoke — ~$20** (gpt-5.6-terra, 3 pairs).\n5. **Confirmatory — ~$700–1,500 all-GPT**, sized by the power analysis — only after everything above is green.\n\nSo the immediate move is yours, not mine: **book the seal session**. While you do that I can resolve the two competitor pins so nothing blocks the ladder. Want me to fix those pins now, and do you want the null test fired the moment the seal lands?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54,"cache_read_input_tokens":445478,"output_tokens":1860,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":892},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1860,"cache_read_input_tokens":445478,"cache_creation_input_tokens":54,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":54},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCH94VNncJH6NLa4K55j","type":"assistant","uuid":"90c2f763-8f7a-410a-9089-fd4440c40c7c","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:39:38.886Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
