{"parentUuid":"2514e35e-ab53-4251-89f5-ba0d2c4d3148","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCHJyZVLmx4MQmx21x7h","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Six arms, every one solving the same task B on the same code — only the memory packet differs:\n\n| # | Arm | What it gets |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **plain baseline** (`no_brain`) | nothing — \"(no prior-session memory available)\" |\n| 2 | **eg / brain** (`full_brain`) | session A distilled by entire-brain, one frozen retrieval — **the only brain arm** |\n| 3 | **placebo** (`irrelevant`) | real-looking memory from the *wrong* session, same size — catches \"any context helps\" |\n| 4 | **mem0** | same session-A bytes through mem0, top-k retrieved |\n| 5 | **graphify** | same bytes through graphify |\n| 6 | **cmm** | same bytes through codebase-memory-mcp |\n\nSession A runs **once** per pair; all six B-sessions get their packet through the identical envelope. Agent: gpt-5.6-sol via Azure (terra as the second model later).\n\nThe three comparisons that fall out: **brain vs nothing** (does memory help), **brain vs placebo** (is it the content, not just padding), **brain vs mem0/graphify/cmm** (do we beat the market on identical inputs)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1649,"cache_read_input_tokens":447443,"output_tokens":484,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":77},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1649,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":484,"cache_read_input_tokens":447443,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1649,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1649},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCHJrFTCnwPM2wXR