{"parentUuid":"1e8278d1-adef-4a90-b00b-1191718a4741","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCHM3PynQ9qWy16WDoGt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"| Rung | What | Est. cost |\n|---|---|---|\n| Seal session | you + teammate, ~4–5h each | **$0** |\n| Null test | 3 dev pairs, empty packets, machinery-inert check | **~$15** |\n| Pilot | 10 dev pairs × 6 arms × 2 reps + 10 A-sessions, gpt-5.6-sol | **~$60–120** |\n| 2nd-model smoke | 3 pairs on gpt-5.6-terra | **~$20** |\n| Confirmatory | n≈150–200 pairs × 6 arms × 2 reps + A-sessions + fresh split + terra subset | **~$700–1,500** |\n\n**Total to a publishable result: roughly $800–1,650**, all-GPT via your Azure creds. Add ~$5–15 total of competitor prep (mem0's LLM ingest). Optional later: an Opus-tier headline cell (~$8–15k) only if reviewers/marketing demand a frontier-model table — not needed for the paper.\n\nDecision structure protects the budget: after the ~$100 pilot you'll know the effect size and the power analysis will tell you the exact n the confirmatory needs — if the effect is big, n shrinks and the last rung gets cheaper; if it's null, you stop at ~$150 total spent."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30,"cache_read_input_tokens":449576,"output_tokens":488,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":45},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":488,"cache_read_input_tokens":449576,"cache_creation_input_tokens":30,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":30},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCHLx5k5iX4jfpVpQcTE","type":"assistant","uuid":"dce3ce6f-5218-4116-896f-8d2