{"parentUuid":"da321b65-7132-4e2f-a880-35c05848292a","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14986567 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1397e4d6-8516-4004-a101-27b0f0de9716","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:48:07.216Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"1397e4d6-8516-4004-a101-27b0f0de9716","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCHpvr7ZKEaFnwvQPv82","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Published: [github.com/entirehq/brainmark](https://github.com/entirehq/brainmark) — private, in entirehq.**\n\nWhat it contains:\n\n- **Clean plain README** at the root — straightforward sections (what it measures, the six arms, fairness rules, layout, requirements, run ladder with costs, status), zero em dashes, verified by grep.\n- **Self-contained tree**: `run.py` harness + the full `brainmark/` benchmark, with the heavyweight historical evidence dirs pruned (22MB total). The old harness README is preserved as `HARNESS-LANES.md`.\n- **Proven standalone**: publishing surfaced two real issues which are now fixed — `run.py` needs the `analysis/` package (restored), and one test assumed derived review sheets exist on disk (now skips in fresh checkouts; that fix is also committed and pushed to the entire-brain branch so PR #88 stays in sync). Final state: **326 tests green + 5 skips in a fresh clone**.\n\nBoth homes now exist: the development branch inside entire-brain (PR #88) and this standalone private repo for sharing with the team. Still holding at the money line — next moves are your seal session and the $15 null-test go."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":382,"cache_read_input_tokens":463176,"output_tokens":406,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":382,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":463176,"cache_creation_input_tokens":382,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":382},"type