{"parentUuid":"3c622a73-d9a6-4884-9d3d-a92252d3207d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCJ3ernuM9v8wnD4whbe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Creds live locally and verified. Launching the run operator — sequential, gated, hard budget stop:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":466265,"output_tokens":1790,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":108},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1790,"cache_read_input_tokens":466265,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCJ3Yxqi3cNg8DGWrrQk","type":"assistant","uuid":"b31e7c11-2f69-4386-a909-5b6acd77b65e","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:51:10.025Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"b31e7c11-2f69-4386-a909-5b6acd77b65e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCJ3ernuM9v8wnD4whbe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ToWkHo4W1rzzRw6ejWRiCx","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Execute null test + 3-arm pilot","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"opus","prompt":"You are the run operator for BrainMark's first PAID runs. Working dir /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark/. Use rtk. USER-APPROVED SCOPE: 3 arms ONLY (no_brain, full_brain, mem0), null test then pilot, on gpt-5.6-sol via Azure (~/.azure_env exists and is verified; codex CLI 0.147.0 on PATH; entire-brain binary at bin/entire-brain; docker works). HARD BUDGET STOP: if cumulative estimated spend reaches $120, stop everything and report. Record actual usage per phase.\n\nREAD FIRST: README.md, REVIEWING-QUICKSTART.md is NOT needed; but read config.json, agents/backends.json, run_b.py --help, session_a.py --help, memsources/mem0_source.py, report.py --help. The dev-pair proposal is in review/SLATE.json (20 dev pairs).\n\nSEQUENCE (each phase gates the next — a failed gate = STOP and report, do not improvise fixes that change the benchmark):\n\n0. PREP (~$0-3):\n   - Create a venv (scratch: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af/scratchpad/brainmark-runs/venv), pip install mem0ai (pin the version; record it). Configure mem0 to use Azure OpenAI for its extraction LLM + embedder per its docs and our COMPETITORS.md pins (record exact config). If mem0's Azure wiring fights back for >30 min, report the blocker instead of burning time.\n   - Select the 10 dev pairs: first 10 of SLATE.json's dev proposal (deterministic; record ids).\n   - Sanity: one $0.01-class direct Azure chat call through the codex adapter path to prove auth end to end (a 1-token completion via codex exec with the gpt-5.6-sol deployment).\n1. NULL TEST (~$10-15): 3 dev pairs x (no_brain + full_brain-with-EMPTY-packet) x 2 reps, gpt-5.6-sol, using run_b's null/force_empty_packet mode (it exists — tests exercise it). Session A NOT needed for null mode if the harness allows sentinel-only; if session A is required, run the 3 A-sessions and count their cost. GATE: report.py deltas for the primary metric and tokens must straddle zero (|point estimate| < ~10%, CI includes 0). If the null FAILS: STOP, report, touch nothing.\n2. SESSION A (~$10-20): run session A once for each of the 10 dev pairs (gpt-5.6-sol, timeouts per config). Pin transcripts (the harness does sha256 pinning). Gate: >=8/10 A-sessions valid (nonzero usage, transcript parsed); drop invalid pairs symmetrically.\n3. PACKETS (~$1-5): build full_brain packets (bin/entire-brain distill on pinned transcripts — use the pinned distill config; distill agent = codex on gpt-5.6-sol, cheap effort) and mem0 packets (ingest same bytes, top-k retrieve with B's problem statement). no_brain = sentinel. Verify packet sha pinning + prompt symmetry gate passes across the 3 arms for every pair BEFORE any B session.\n4. PILOT B (~$25-50): 10 pairs x 3 arms x 2 reps = 60 B-sessions, gpt-5.6-sol, concurrency <= 6 (this is a laptop — do not starve it; load pressure is a known confound, keep concurrency CONSTANT across arms). Idempotent resume on.\n5. GRADE + REPORT ($0): docker grading (remember arm64: docker pull --platform linux/amd64 per REPRODUCIBILITY.md) for resolved%; run report.py + power_analysis.py. \nDELIVER (caveman-ultra, max 30 lines): per-phase actual cost + total; null-test verdict with numbers; pilot table — per arm vs no_brain: locate_calls_pre_edit ratio [CI], token ratio [CI], median, resolved k/n, prep cost; power analysis output (required n for confirmatory); any dropped pairs + why; every gate result. Save the full report to results/ and state the path. Do NOT push/commit anything."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_read_input_tokens":466265,"output_tokens":1790,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":108},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1790,"cache_read_input_tokens":466265,"cache_creation_input_tokens":709,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":709},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCJ3Yxqi3cNg8DGWrrQk","type":"assistant","uuid":"62aee2e9-7990-4dd8-9b97-bbfd3361cc37","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:51:35.241Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
