{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01V2Ld7oByJHzCPrgzdbD6ad","lastSequenceNum":0,"noHistoryBackfill":true,"ownerAccountUuid":"00b6ef77-2993-4ccf-a0c2-108181d81f1f","ownerOrganizationUuid":"15c59575-010f-483d-b3ad-83e0f09c6dba"}
{"parentUuid":"36f88b2b-0682-45c2-962b-013aa077c316","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCJ6HspZZJtAw8jhdiSr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**The first paid run is live.** The operator executes strictly in sequence, each phase gated:\n\n1. **Prep** (~$0–3): mem0 installed + wired to Azure, dev pairs locked (first 10 of the proposal), one tiny auth-proof call.\n2. **Null test** (~$10–15): empty-packet machinery check — **if deltas don't straddle zero, everything stops there.**\n3. **Session A** × 10, pinned.\n4. **Packets** for all three arms, symmetry-verified before any B session.\n5. **Pilot**: 60 B-sessions (10 pairs × 3 arms × 2 reps) on gpt-5.6-sol, constant concurrency ≤6.\n6. **Docker grading + report**: the arm-vs-baseline table (locate-calls ratio, token ratio, CIs, medians, resolved rate) plus the power analysis that sizes the confirmatory run.\n\nHard budget stop at $120 cumulative; nothing gets committed or pushed. Wall-clock is likely a few hours — I'll report the moment the null verdict lands (that's the first real news), then the pilot table."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2183,"cache_read_input_tokens":466974,"output_tokens":379,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2183,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":466974,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2183,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2183},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCJ6BT7MeEjR3HCPmyqv","type":"assistant","uuid":"bde3d832-1a8c-4941-b14e-38f053edd317","timestamp":"2026-08-19T14:51:47.413Z","effort