{"parentUuid":"bd246910-d3b8-4b1f-a436-a18a192451f8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCJrKdTj3d3e4pmEUKKz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes — it's running on your Mac (the worktree, repo-cache, Docker, and the codex sessions all live locally; only the model calls go out to Azure).\n\nWhat that means for you:\n\n- **Load is modest**: the B-sessions are network-bound API calls, capped at 6-way — nothing like the heavy local benchmark cells. Docker grading at the end pulls a few multi-GB images.\n- **Keep the lid open / machine awake** — sleep kills the run mid-flight (it resumes idempotently, but wall-clock stretches). `caffeinate` is the usual trick if you're stepping away.\n- **Disk**: a few GB for grading images; we have ~94GB free.\n- Expected wall-clock: a few hours end to end.\n\nIf you'd rather not have it on your machine, say the word and I'll stop it cleanly (resume-safe) and stage the whole thing on **mem0harness-1** instead — it's idle, has Docker and the Azure env already, and just needs the harness + repo-cache synced (~15–20 min setup). Otherwise it keeps going here."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":469157,"output_tokens":673,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":317},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":410},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":673,"cache_read_input_tokens":469157,"cache_creation_input_tokens":410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":410,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCJrED2pXMkxXGzsiGrx","type":"assistant","uuid":"f29c57ec-5e67-465d-9b8c-239c0c19948a","timestamp":"2026-08-1