{"parentUuid":"263b3cb0-4336-40d6-81a4-496f62d46b6b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCJtFppYejiy9uosYPx4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Roughly **3–5 hours end to end**, broken down:\n\n| Phase | Est. |\n|---|---|\n| Prep (mem0 setup + auth proof) | 10–20 min |\n| Null test (12 small B-sessions + gate) | 30–45 min — **first real news lands here** |\n| Session A × 10 | 20–35 min |\n| Packet building (distill + mem0 ingest) | 15–30 min |\n| Pilot: 60 B-sessions at 6-way | **1.5–2.5 h** (the bulk) |\n| Docker grading + report | 30–60 min (mostly image pulls, first time only) |\n\nSo: null-test verdict within the hour, the full pilot table with CIs and the power analysis by roughly tonight+4h. I'll report at both checkpoints. If the machine sleeps it pauses and resumes, but the clock stretches — `caffeinate` if you're stepping away."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29,"cache_read_input_tokens":470240,"output_tokens":747,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":443},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":747,"cache_read_input_tokens":470240,"cache_creation_input_tokens":29,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":29},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCJt8wLGySoaKdT1wbHn","type":"assistant","uuid":"cc178ba5-0974-4457-8a69-020882eff964","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:02:15.770Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizz