{"parentUuid":"57a02e28-6571-4daf-adc6-379ce386de4c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"total_tokens_reminder","text":"<total_tokens>14994023 tokens left</total_tokens>"},"type":"attachment","uuid":"4b906bf2-364f-4847-b605-3ebdf9069bc5","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:05:31.346Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"4b906bf2-364f-4847-b605-3ebdf9069bc5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCK9tJxPhTmiVqhM8H4G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EEk1EgXuyossbyiX5tqmB9","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"VM: null test + 3-arm pilot","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"opus","prompt":"You are the run operator for BrainMark's first PAID runs, executing ON THE GCP VM mem0harness-1 (zone us-east1-b) via `gcloud compute ssh mem0harness-1 --zone=us-east1-b --command='...'`. Use rtk locally where possible. USER-APPROVED SCOPE: 3 arms ONLY (no_brain, full_brain, mem0), null test then pilot, gpt-5.6-sol via Azure. HARD BUDGET STOP at $120 estimated cumulative spend. The VM: 16 cores, 58GB RAM, 120GB free, docker + python3 present, ~/.azure_env already there, x86_64 (Docker grading needs NO platform workaround). Already shipped to VM home: entire-brain-linux (binary), brainmark.bundle (git bundle of the standalone repo), brainmark-data.tgz (candidates/ + review/).\n\nVM SETUP (do first):\n1. `git clone ~/brainmark.bundle ~/brainmark` (clones the bundle; branch main), `cd ~/brainmark && tar xzf ~/brainmark-data.tgz -C brainmark/` (data lands at brainmark/candidates + brainmark/review), `install -m755 ~/entire-brain-linux brainmark/bin/entire-brain` (REPLACE the mac binary).\n2. Install codex CLI: `sudo apt-get update -qq && sudo apt-get install -y -qq nodejs npm` then `sudo npm i -g @openai/codex`; verify `codex --version`. If apt's node is too old for codex, use `curl -fsSL https://deb.nodesource.com/setup_22.x | sudo bash -` first.\n3. Repo checkouts: the pilot needs worktrees of the 10 dev pairs' repos. Read brainmark/review/SLATE.json dev proposal (first 10 pairs = the run set; record ids). Use brainmark/clone_repos.py --only-repos for those repos into the repo-cache path set in brainmark/config.json — BUT config.json's graphmark_root points at a Mac path; create the VM equivalent dir (~/graphmark-cache or similar), update a VM-LOCAL copy of config (do NOT commit) so repo_cache + any absolute paths resolve on the VM. IMPORTANT: run_b checks out worktrees from these clones, so they must NOT be blob:none for the pair repos actually used — full-clone just those (~10 repos).\n4. mem0: python3 venv on the VM, pip install mem0ai (pin + record version), configure for Azure OpenAI (endpoint/key/api-version from ~/.azure_env) for both its LLM and embedder per its docs + brainmark/COMPETITORS.md. If Azure wiring fights >30 min, STOP and report the blocker.\n5. Auth proof: one ~1-token codex exec against the gpt-5.6-sol deployment (record cost).\n\nTHEN THE GATED LADDER (all runs detached on the VM under setsid with logs in ~/brainmark-runs/, poll via ssh; never scp over a running script; deploy scripts to temp + atomic mv):\nA. NULL TEST (~$10-15): 3 dev pairs x (no_brain + full_brain-with-EMPTY-packet) x 2 reps using run_b's null/force_empty_packet mode; run A-sessions only if the harness requires them. GATE: report.py primary + token deltas straddle zero (|point|<~10%, CI includes 0). Fail => STOP, report.\nB. SESSION A x10 (~$10-20): pin transcripts. GATE: >=8/10 valid; symmetric drops.\nC. PACKETS (~$1-5): full_brain (entire-brain distill, agent=codex on gpt-5.6-sol cheap effort; then ONE frozen retrieval per pair) + mem0 (ingest same bytes, retrieve with B's problem statement) + sentinel. GATE: packet sha pinning + 3-arm prompt symmetry passes for every pair BEFORE any B session.\nD. PILOT B (~$25-50): 10 pairs x 3 arms x 2 reps = 60 B-sessions, concurrency 8 constant across arms, idempotent resume.\nE. GRADE+REPORT ($0): docker grading natively, report.py + power_analysis.py.\n\nDELIVER (caveman-ultra, max 30 lines): per-phase actual cost + total; null verdict w/ numbers; pilot table per arm vs no_brain (locate_calls_pre_edit ratio [CI], token ratio [CI], median, resolved k/n, prep cost); power-analysis required n; dropped pairs + why; gate results; paths of full results on the VM. Do NOT commit/push anything anywhere."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":425,"cache_read_input_tokens":476599,"output_tokens":1755,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":425,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1755,"cache_read_input_tokens":476599,"cache_creation_input_tokens":425,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":425},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCK9mno5zuJu2H8QE5xZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ec27603-6f12-4fa9-b32e-1bbede41b7d2","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:05:59.649Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
