{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01V2Ld7oByJHzCPrgzdbD6ad","lastSequenceNum":0,"noHistoryBackfill":true,"ownerAccountUuid":"00b6ef77-2993-4ccf-a0c2-108181d81f1f","ownerOrganizationUuid":"15c59575-010f-483d-b3ad-83e0f09c6dba"}
{"parentUuid":"c3f6e5f2-87cc-423d-910b-5260fde5c042","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCKVzRs5krnBJo4Popgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"output_tokens":1284,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":576},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1284,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCKVqhW8hwzeTobSmd2t","type":"assistant","uuid":"32d68be2-6694-4565-afc8-ee5455e5b6b4","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:10:20.883Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"32d68be2-6694-4565-afc8-ee5455e5b6b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCKVzRs5krnBJo4Popgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes and yes:\n\n**It's the pilot, not the full run.** 10 dev pairs × 3 arms × 2 reps = 60 B-sessions plus 10 A-sessions and the null test — roughly $50–95. The confirmatory full run (n≈150–200 pairs, ~$400–900) only happens after this pilot's power analysis says what n is needed, and after your explicit go.\n\n**Parallelization** — it already runs concurrently (8-way on the 16-core VM), and I'm bumping it to 12-way with two guardrails that can't move:\n\n1. **Concurrency stays constant across arms** — we have hard prior evidence that load pressure inflates whichever arm runs under it and can flip the sign of a benchmark. Uneven parallelism between arms would corrupt the comparison.\n2. **Azure rate limits**: if the deployment starts returning 429s at 12-way, sessions retry asymmetrically — the operator watches for that in the null phase and drops back to 8 if it appears.\n\nWhat can't be parallelized: the phase gates themselves (null must pass before real money; packets need session A finished) — that sequencing is the safety mechanism, not overhead. Net effect of the bump: pilot B goes from ~8 waves to ~5, saving ~30–45 minutes."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"output_tokens":1284,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":576},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1284,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCKVqhW8hwzeTobSmd2t","type":"assistant","uuid":"37f2246e-be89-4678-acf5-43b51e812b10","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:10:26.556Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"37f2246e-be89-4678-acf5-43b51e812b10","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCKVzRs5krnBJo4Popgf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01URmzufj3imp122DQjpYuQd","name":"SendMessage","input":{"to":"a9a7a65b9e3bcb8d9","summary":"Raise concurrency to 12, constant across arms","message":"Adjustment from the user: raise B-session concurrency from 8 to 12 (VM has 16 cores). Two hard rules: (1) concurrency must be CONSTANT across arms within a phase — never let one arm run under different load than another (known sign-flipping confound); (2) watch for Azure 429/rate-limit responses during the null phase — if any appear, drop back to 8 for everything and note it in the report. Phase gates stay strictly sequential as briefed. Everything else unchanged.","type":"message","recipient":"a9a7a65b9e3bcb8d9","content":"Adjustment from the user: raise B-session concurr…"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"output_tokens":1284,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":576},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1284,"cache_read_input_tokens":479191,"cache_creation_input_tokens":389,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":389,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCKVqhW8hwzeTobSmd2t","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c8e9310-44d9-4a0d-a530-cd9836cdb3bb","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:10:30.180Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brai