{"parentUuid":"3b31ef9a-60fe-4850-876a-ed3aa8c54921","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCN82swr2e4Kr2Ky1q8K","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ahead of schedule — the ladder is past its riskiest gates:\n\n- **Null test: COMPLETE** (12 cells, 0 harness errors, rc=0). There's also an artifact suggesting the operator caught an arm-name-visibility issue in a first null attempt and re-ran it clean — exactly what the null phase is for; numbers in its final report.\n- **Session A: 10/10 valid** (gate needed ≥8) — no dropped pairs.\n- **Packets: building now.** One thing visible in the logs: mem0's ingest is throwing \"error processing memory action\" on some items — could be mem0-internal parse noise or could thin its packets; the operator records it either way and it counts as mem0's honest behavior on identical inputs, not something we tune for them.\n\nRemaining: 60 pilot B-sessions at 12-way (~45–90 min) then native Docker grading + the report. **Revised ETA for the full pilot table: ~1.5–2.5 h from now.**"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_read_input_tokens":482256,"output_tokens":724,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":399},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":724,"cache_read_input_tokens":482256,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1160,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1160},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCN7pJeWsHz9q3EDZnv5","type":"assistant","uuid":"76617e0b-e445-495d-a57a-85cb0a824af2","timestamp":"2026-08-19T15:44:44.059Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e