{"parentUuid":"a0f87957-ae94-48e3-bf60-88f9966fffee","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCSDyQxuc6iBmgKaPBuV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```\nSetup        ████████████ done\nNull test    ████████████ done (gate passed)\nSession A    ████████████ done (10/10)\nPackets      ████████████ done (3 arms pinned)\nPilot B      ████████████ done (60/60, 0 errors)\nGrading      ██████░░░░░░ RUNNING  ← lucene eval container live now, 12 images pulled\nReport       ░░░░░░░░░░░░ next\n```\n\n**ETA: ~15–30 min.** Grading is the only thing left with real wall-clock (per-pair image pull + test run; lucene is one of the heavier ones), then the report and power analysis are near-instant. The final table lands in the operator's report the moment it's through."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_read_input_tokens":485752,"output_tokens":349,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":110},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":485752,"cache_creation_input_tokens":350,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":350},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCSDsLbHwZfC2rHVhjTC","type":"assistant","uuid":"6a5e1c77-e42e-4db6-8996-c2e91fcc19cf","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:38:27.536Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
