{"parentUuid":"37e402dd-0339-428e-8ccf-2f6954616d11","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCSiL3irq8txFBB5DcqC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Xg79zgt4WFtJdSmLnUYSVr","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Backport VM pilot fixes","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"opus","prompt":"Backport the pilot's harness fixes from the GCP VM into the source repos. Use rtk. The pilot run operator left its exact VM-local deltas at mem0harness-1:~/bmscripts/patches/*.diff (with *.orig beside each patched file) — fetch them: `gcloud compute ssh mem0harness-1 --zone=us-east1-b --command='cat ~/bmscripts/patches/<file>'` (list them first; also read ~/bmscripts/ drivers if a patch references them).\n\nApply the applicable fixes to /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark/ (branch feat/brainmark). The six known fixes (map each patch to these; skip VM-environment-only ones like apt/venv paths):\n1. agents/backends.json Azure URL shape: correct is <endpoint>/openai/v1 with NO api-version for this Foundry resource.\n2. mem0 config deviation (extractor gpt-5.6-sol, embedder local MiniLM-384 because Azure has no embedding deployment): record in COMPETITORS.md as a FORCED deviation with rationale, and make the mem0_source config match.\n3. distill codex/Azure plumbing: the PATH shim that injects provider config when the caller supplied none — port it as a documented harness helper (not a hack buried in scripts), invoked by the full_brain memsource.\n4. Transcript canonicalization: codex ThreadEvent JSONL -> canonical form pinned beside the raw stream, byte-identical input to every memory arm — port into session_a.py/memsources as the operator implemented it.\n5. mechmetrics codex parsing: item.type (not item.item_type) + shell command extraction from \"/usr/bin/bash -lc '...'\" strings — port + EXTEND THE CODEX FIXTURES so a regression test would have caught both (the primary metric was silently 0; that must be impossible to reintroduce — add a fixture asserting nonzero locate calls from a real 0.148-shaped stream).\n6. FAIRNESS: worktrees must live at opaque hashed paths outside the results tree (no arm name in pwd, no sibling packets readable) — port the run_b change + add a test asserting the worktree path contains neither the arm name nor the results root.\nThen: run the full test suite (must be green; extend tests where the fixes need pinning), commit on feat/brainmark (1-2 commits, no AI footers), push, and mirror the same commits to the standalone repo: clone https://github.com/entirehq/brainmark (gh auth works) to a temp dir, apply the same changes (paths differ: repo root = agent-brain root there), verify its suite (326+ green), commit+push to its main.\nReport caveman-ultra: per fix = ported/skipped + file:line, new fixture/test names, both suites' tallies, commit shas both repos. Max 18 lines."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2928,"cache_read_input_tokens":486102,"output_tokens":3794,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1616},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2928,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3794,"cache_read_input_tokens":486102,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2928},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCSiC5VjpVQ2xj15MeQd","type":"assistant","uuid":"7d9d9e6a-5df4-4656-9bf3-66d1ca9ed613","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:45:42.333Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brai