{"parentUuid":"34a53388-3a68-4e13-a209-b0ceb23ef555","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/suhaan/.claude/projects/-Users-suhaan-devenv/memory/brainmark-state.md","snippet":"19\tdual-rater seal w/ kappa, anonymizer 0-hit gate, croissant validates under real mlcroissant,\n20\tDocker grading smoke RESOLVED (arm64: manual `docker pull --platform linux/amd64` first —\n21\tdocumented in REPRODUCIBILITY.md). 331 tests green.\n22\t\n23\tNEXT (blocked on user): (1) seal session — user + one teammate, review/ packets ready,\n24\t~3.5-5.5h/rater per REVIEWING-QUICKSTART.md; (2) paid ladder, each rung needs GO: null test ~$15 →\n25\tpilot gpt-5.6-sol ~$60-120 → confirmatory ~$700-1,500 all-GPT. Never merge PR #88 without approval.\n26\tRelated: [[keystone-3-prs-open]], [[locomo-terra-result]].\n27\t\n28\t**PILOT DONE 2026-08-19 ($6.24 placeholder-priced, VM mem0harness-1):** null PASSED (after fixing a\n29\tpwd arm-name leak — null re-run); pilot n=20: full_brain locate −17.8% [CI incl 0], mem0 −1.4%,\n30\tresolved saturated 14-15/20 — direction favors brain, NOT significant by design. Power: 46 pairs\n31\t@2reps. Confirmatory projects ~$50-150 (burn ~$0.07/cell), not $700-1500. mem0 prep 20x slower\n32\t(58.8s vs 3.0s/pair). Six harness bugs found+fixed in pilot (dead primary metric via codex\n33\titem.type; silent-null memory arms via transcript format; distill billing public OpenAI; Azure\n34\tURL shape; mem0 undeployable defaults→forced deviation disclosed; worktree pwd leak). Fixes\n35\tbackported to both repos. BLOCKER: human seal session. Never quote pilot deltas as results."},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5b517472-34ad-48a4-9a5e-8dcfb5e5cfb0","timestamp":"2026-08-19T16:46:12.426Z","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark/benchmarks/agent-brain/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"