{"parentUuid":"3e26df8f-1b1d-47bc-acd4-48a4dabb9ee7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCSqD3yxajvAxqUwg9Gs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything is recorded and the backport agent is porting the six pilot fixes into both repos (the feat/brainmark branch and the standalone entirehq/brainmark).\n\n**Where you stand tonight, in one view:**\n\n- **BrainMark works.** Null passed, 60/60 pilot cells clean, $6.24 spent, and the direction favors the brain (−17.8% re-derivation vs mem0's −1.4%, with a 20× prep-speed advantage) — pending significance at real n.\n- **The confirmatory run is now cheap** (~$50–150, sized at 46+ pairs × 2 reps by the power analysis) — money is no longer the gate.\n- **The only blocker is human**: your seal session with a teammate. The packets and quickstart are ready; roughly one afternoon each.\n- Also still parked on your desk from earlier: merging keystone PRs #114/#2041/#87, P1's #85/#242, and BrainMark's own PR #88.\n\nI'll confirm when the backport lands. After the seal, one \"go\" runs the confirmatory — and then we know whether the flagship number is real."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1310,"cache_read_input_tokens":493935,"output_tokens":366,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1310,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":366,"cache_read_input_tokens":493935,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1310,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1310},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCSq7JxGWtQMiQeuAgUJ","type":"assistant","uuid":"d056b40e-4990-438e-afc8-e55f60140b2e","timestamp":"2