{"parentUuid":"18a44e8c-280b-4ef5-904f-4c97266a45ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCUAA9zteZ6LhpnDALWQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Opus builder is on it, in a fresh worktree (`p0p1/brain-onboarding`, off main). Scope it's implementing:\n\n1. **`entire-brain setup`** — one command: instant deterministic phase (seconds, brain queryable immediately), then detached newest-first backfill with the existing budget/cursor gates.\n2. **The daemon you asked for**: workspace registration + one machine-wide `workspace watch` daemon, installed via launchd (Mac) / systemd user unit (Linux), idempotent, with `--no-daemon` and `--uninstall-daemon`.\n3. Session-end hook wiring verified, and **status shows \"facts: N/M sessions distilled\"** + daemon health.\n\nValidation is baked into the brief: unit tests + golden files, a **live smoke on this machine** in a throwaway isolated repo (including real launchctl load/verify/uninstall with test-unique labels), and two mutation checks (idempotence, newest-first ordering). After it reports, the usual pipeline: adversarial review → fixes → push → PR. Meanwhile the BrainMark backport is still finishing in parallel."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2301,"cache_read_input_tokens":498178,"output_tokens":379,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2301,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":379,"cache_read_input_tokens":498178,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2301,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2301},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCUA4rGCpvr53wQr1Mqt","type":"assist