{"parentUuid":"f4ac0099-ef98-40da-81a4-c14defccdde8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCURfZjxY3FPTYZATqpr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Backport complete — all six pilot fixes are now in both repos and **pushed** (PR #88 updated; standalone `entirehq/brainmark` main updated). +45 new tests each side (376 green in entire-brain, 371 in standalone), with the two metric-killing bugs and the fairness fix pinned by mutation-verified regression tests.\n\nOne honest flag it surfaced: the backport's stricter testing caught a TOML-quoting bug **in the VM's own shim** — meaning the pilot's distill step may have run with codex silently falling back rather than cleanly on Azure. The pilot's full_brain packets clearly worked (facts existed, the signal showed), but that's one more reason pilot numbers stay unquotable and the confirmatory — which will run on the *fixed* shim — is the number that counts."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2176,"cache_read_input_tokens":500479,"output_tokens":1071,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":514},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2176,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1071,"cache_read_input_tokens":500479,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2176},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCURaHjn369AyBhxnDWb","type":"assistant","uuid":"5f74a515-2244-4b74-b093-580db567a572","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:07:24.748Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272