{"parentUuid":"5472f2a5-7e5a-4e2c-8ca4-196b3bfe220e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCVcZ5ywNJzybGbtDmxv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_read_input_tokens":503757,"output_tokens":677,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":115},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":503757,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCVcTDmAZVqUKT9xYHpy","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d50654e-309d-4b37-ade9-b1813d678720","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:22:53.333Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"0d50654e-309d-4b37-ade9-b1813d678720","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCVcZ5ywNJzybGbtDmxv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The pilot is **done** — it finished earlier tonight. Recap of the results:\n\n**Cost: $6.24 total** (vs the ~$100 budget). All gates passed: null test inert ✅, 10/10 session-A ✅, 60/60 pilot cells, zero drops ✅.\n\n| vs no-memory | re-derivation work (locate calls) | tokens | solved |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **brain** | **−17.8%** [CI −37.8 to +8.0] | −2.3% | 14/20 |\n| mem0 | −1.4% [CI −20.8 to +23.8] | +0.0% | 14/20 |\n| baseline | — | — | 15/20 |\n\nPlain reading: **the direction favors the brain — it cuts re-derivation work ~18% while mem0 does nothing — but at n=10 pairs nothing is statistically significant yet**, exactly as a pilot should be. Bonus stat: brain memory costs 3.0s/pair to build vs mem0's 58.8s (20× slower).\n\n**What the pilot bought beyond the numbers:** the power analysis (need **46 sealed pairs at 2 reps** for a properly powered result), a revised confirmatory cost of **~$50–150** (way down from $700–1,500), and six harness bugs found and fixed — all now backported and pushed to both repos.\n\n**What stands between you and the real, quotable number:**\n1. **Seal session** — you + a teammate, ~an afternoon, packets ready.\n2. **Confirmatory go** (~$50–150) — one word from you once the seal is done.\n\nMeanwhile the brain-onboarding builder is still working; that's the only thing currently in flight."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_read_input_tokens":503757,"output_tokens":677,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":115},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":677,"cache_read_input_tokens":503757,"cache_creation_input_tokens":149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCVcTDmAZVqUKT9xYHpy","type":"assistant","uuid":"495399c1-9f93-40f6-8556-9b194bbf0464","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:23:00.651Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
