{"parentUuid":"e6043fe7-8732-4dd0-bd41-34ecf921c53a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCVj6fSdJWVUJU1G3fv4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":556,"cache_read_input_tokens":506078,"output_tokens":912,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":57},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":556,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":912,"cache_read_input_tokens":506078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":556,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":556},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCVj1mm26A6FZ5saFqya","type":"assistant","uuid":"43aa278a-e6f2-45a4-82f9-f1fc01c99415","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:24:31.914Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"43aa278a-e6f2-45a4-82f9-f1fc01c99415","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCVj6fSdJWVUJU1G3fv4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Understood — BrainMark (#88) is parked. Here is the complete merge list to get to P2, in order:\n\n## The 5 PRs between you and P2\n\n### Gate 1 — P1 goes live (the actual P2 entry requirement)\n| # | PR | What | State |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | **entire-brain [#85](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/85)** | P1 client: canonical wire, signing, proposal sync | **MERGEABLE, clean** — needs your merge |\n| 2 | **entire-api [#242](https://github.com/entirehq/entire-api/pull/242)** | P1 server: store, CAS sync, remote MCP, tenancy | Open, **needs a review approval** (branch protection), wire-verified against #85 by the live round-trip |\n\nAfter both: staging deploys automatically → set `ENTIRE_BRAIN_HOSTED_ENABLED=true` on staging cells → smoke → same flag on prod. That flag flip **is** P1 done, and P1 is P2's formal gate.\n\n### Gate 2 — Keystone (scheduled between P1 and P2)\n| # | PR | What | State |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 3 | **entire-graph [#114](https://github.com/entireio/entire-graph/pull/114)** | version-stamp diff output | **still DRAFT** (from your accidental close/reopen) — needs marking ready, merge FIRST of the three (it's the producer) |\n| 4 | **cli [#2041](https://github.com/entireio/cli/pull/2041)** | entity deltas in checkpoint metadata (gate off by default) | Open, **review required** — the other team's surface, will take longest |\n| 5 | **entire-brain [#87](https://github.com/entireio/entire-brain/pull/87)** | entity→checkpoint index + MCP tool | **MERGEABLE, clean** — needs your merge |\n\nStrictly speaking, P2 only *requires* Gate 1; the keystone can land in parallel with early P2 work (P3 is what hard-depends on it).\n\n**Parked (revisit later)**: BrainMark #88, the seal session, the confirmatory run — all state preserved in the repos and notepad.\n\n**Your fastest path**: merge #85 and #87 yourself (both clean, same repo, you own it), mark #114 ready and merge, then chase one approval each on #242 and #2041 from their owners. Two of the five need another human; three are one click. Say the word and I'll mark #114 ready — merging stays your call."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":556,"cache_read_input_tokens":506078,"output_tokens":912,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":57},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":556,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":912,"cache_read_input_tokens":506078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":556,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":556},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCVj1mm26A6FZ5saFqya","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e45e491-fb12-4e06-bd4a-bc009b8882d7","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:24:32.471Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
