{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:39:31.802Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a987732d5d75e2a5c</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d/tasks/a987732d5d75e2a5c.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Build brain setup onboarding\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Done. Report:\n\n**FILES** (branch `feat/brain-setup-onboarding`, 5 commits, not pushed)\n- `internal/cli/setup.go` — `newSetupCommand`:148, `runSetup`:190 (3 phases), `runSetupDaemon`:321, `runSetupBackfill`:355, `registerRepoInWorkspace`:528\n- `internal/cli/setup_daemon.go` — `planBrainWatchDaemon`:88 (GOOS is an **arg**, not `runtime.GOOS`), `renderLaunchdPlist`:145, `renderSystemdUnit`:188, `inspectDaemon`:236, `installDaemon`:289\n- `internal/cli/setup_status.go` — `factsBackfillStatusForBrain`:64, `renderBrainOnboardingStatus`:159, `inspectSessionEndHook`:237 (reports only; `entire enable` owns wiring)\n- `internal/cli/setup_spawn{,_unix,_windows}.go` — setsid detach + `processAlive`\n- `distill_cmd.go:1369` `sortDistillSessions` + `--newest-first`/`--max-sessions`; `agent_surface.go` `Onboarding` on **existing** `status`; `root.go` registers `setup` first\n\n**SMOKE** (throwaway repo, isolated `ENTIRE_PLUGIN_*` + fake HOME, $0, all cleaned):\n```\nsetup: instant core ready in 400ms — the brain is queryable now\nsetup: fact backfill: no captured sessions yet — it will start once sessions land skipped\nsetup: workspace \"smoke-ws\" now tracks gh/entireio/brain-setup-smoke\nsetup: background watcher installed (io.entire.brain-watch-smoke-31101)\n  facts: 0/0 sessions distilled     daemon: running (io.entire.brain-watch-smoke-31101)\n2nd run: workspace \"smoke-ws\" already has this repo skipped\n2nd run: background watcher already running (...) skipped   [launchctl count still 1]\nstatus: facts: 0/0 sessions distilled | daemon: running (...); last tick 3m0s ago\n        instant: sessions=built seed=built docs=built semantic=built history=missing\nuninstall: removed the watcher io.entire.brain-watch-smoke-31101   [launchctl: GONE; 2nd = no-op]\n```\n`launchctl list` confirmed pid 31138 live; real `~/Library/LaunchAgents` never touched; `inspect code helper` returned `helper.go:3-3` right after the instant phase (0.5s, ≪60s).\n\n**2 REAL BUGS the smoke found (both pre-existing, now fixed + regression-tested)**\n1. `watch --distill` and `hook session-end` built `distillCommandOptions` in Go, so `concurrency==0` → **every** gated distill died at the guard before any agent call. Live A/B: old `distill skipped: --concurrency must be greater than 0` → new `distill skipped: distillation requires an agent…`.\n2. A custom `--daemon-name` was invisible to `status`/`--uninstall-daemon`; setup now records workspace+daemon per repo.\n\n**MUTATIONS** (a) `if false` on the idempotence gate → `TestSetupInstallsExactlyOneDaemonAcrossRuns` FAILED (`installs = 2`); removing workspace dedupe → FAILED. (b) force `newestFirst=false` → 4 tests FAILED (`visited old,mid,new`). Both restored.\n\n**GATES** 47 new tests; `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` = **2478 passed / 11 pkgs**, `gofmt -l` empty, `go vet` clean, `mise run lint` clean, `plutil -lint` OK on the plist golden. No AI footers.\n\n**SHAS** `6a7079a9` distill ordering · `a6106659` daemon glue · `109a3981` setup command · `172fe971` concurrency fix · `0718b885` identity record.\n\n**Caveat:** this machine's installed `entire` CLI derives `local/repo` while the brain derives `local/repo-&lt;hash&gt;`, so the semantic step fails on local repos with no git remote — pre-existing version skew, reproduced on