{"parentUuid":"6b8565cf-9b2a-462f-a836-bd0d722b2c3c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCWu4xQ5Aw29q8KdQomd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The onboarding builder delivered — `entire-brain setup` works end to end in the live smoke (instant core in **400ms**, workspace registered, real launchd daemon installed/verified/uninstalled, idempotent re-run proven with launchctl counts, status shows the distilled counter). It also found two **pre-existing** product bugs, one significant: every gated distill launched from `watch --distill` or the session-end hook was dying at a validation guard before spending anything — meaning the background distill path nobody complained about was silently broken. Fixed with regression tests.\n\nPer your \"validate it\" instruction, the adversarial pass before the PR:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3941,"cache_read_input_tokens":508730,"output_tokens":1647,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":143},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3941,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1647,"cache_read_input_tokens":508730,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3941,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3941},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCWtyDcZndeAgvj9cRMb","type":"assistant","uuid":"eeb9d3c8-d215-418e-b7ca-292470f2aa6c","timestamp":"2026-08-19T17:39:44.847Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-