all three new commits build individually.\n\n**SMOKE** (real `$HOME`, sandboxed store, `ENTIRE_BRAIN_DAEMON_DIR`, stubbed launchctl/codex) — `unit bytes: IDENTICAL across repos`; `service-manager calls during repo B setup: 1 -&gt; launchctl list …` / `daemon restart: NONE (probe only)`; both repo keys present in the manifest; `fact backfill capped at 25 of 200 pending session(s)`; `fact backfill: already running (pid …, 0/200 sessions distilled so far)`; `real ~/Library/LaunchAgents: UNCHANGED throughout`.\n\n**COMMITS** (branch `feat/brain-setup-onboarding`, not pushed, no AI footers): `b5468e40` distill lock, `43564caf` setup fixes, `cacf42e5` docs. Prior 5 commits intact; I added three scoped `fix`/`docs` commits (the branch's existing pattern) rather than splitting intertwined same-file hunks across earlier commits, which would have left non-building intermediates — say the word if you want them folded instead.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>294161</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>148</tool_uses><duration_ms>3638137</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"efe707c8-f0e1-4801-92db-4ab90c392375","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:49:06.648Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification"},"promptSource":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
