{"parentUuid":"bacfb629-44e5-443f-a2fc-163739182b68","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCcCrztr9TNFxeetNf6e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All blockers fixed and mutation-verified — including a smart catch where the skeptic's own suggested fix was wrong (quoting systemd paths actually *breaks* units; the fixer verified against systemd source and implemented specifier-escaping instead, with tests pinning it). Suite 2,507 green, race-checked, and the smoke proves the daemon story end to end: byte-identical units across repos, zero restarts on second-repo setup, backfill capped at 25 and skip-if-running, real LaunchAgents untouched.\n\nPushing and opening the PR:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_read_input_tokens":537702,"output_tokens":1560,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":237},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1560,"cache_read_input_tokens":537702,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCcCmJqY3saoQoqfJU8o","type":"assistant","uuid":"d5a3c4a3-a44f-4938-93f4-447f56eb0d67","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:49:19.544Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brainmark","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"d5a3c4a3-a44f-4938-93f4-447f56eb0d67","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCcCrztr9TNFxeetNf6e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01WJFW1Wh6BoJQZc2s2kFjrR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-onboarding && git push -q -u origin feat/brain-setup-onboarding 2>&1 | grep -v \"^remote\" | tail -1; gh pr create --repo entireio/entire-brain --base main --head feat/brain-setup-onboarding --title \"One-command onboarding: entire-brain setup (instant core, capped backfill, watch daemon)\" --body \"Fixes the onboarding confusion (three separate setup paths, agent pass always runs long, people forget to run it) with one command and one background daemon.\n\n**\\`entire-brain setup\\`** runs three phases:\n1. **Instant core** (blocking, seconds, zero tokens): deterministic refresh (sessions, seed, docs, semantic index). The brain is queryable when it returns (400ms on the smoke repo).\n2. **Background backfill** (detached): distills past sessions **newest first** so useful facts land early. Default spend is **capped at 25 sessions** and disclosed (\\`--backfill-budget 0\\` = explicit unlimited). Skip-if-already-running; cursor prevents re-spend.\n3. **Daemon**: registers the repo in a workspace and ensures ONE machine-wide \\`workspace watch\\` daemon via launchd plist / systemd user unit. Idempotent (second repo's setup makes zero service-manager mutations, proven byte-identical units), \\`--no-daemon\\` / \\`--uninstall-daemon\\`, custom names hash-labeled and rename-safe.\n\nStatus now answers the ashtom question directly: \\`facts: N/M sessions distilled\\` + daemon health + per-component freshness; doctor stays the deep check.\n\n**Behavior changes worth review attention:**\n- Fixes a pre-existing bug where every distill launched from \\`watch --distill\\` or \\`hook session-end\\` died at a validation guard **before any agent call** — those paths now actually spend tokens as documented. Called out in README + CHANGELOG; bounded by \\`--distill-every\\`, the cursor, and the new pass lock.\n- New cross-process **distill pass lock** (try-lock): concurrent distills over one brain dir can't double-spend — covers backfill, watch, hook, and manual runs.\n- Workspace manifest mutations now serialized under a lock (concurrent setups all persist).\n- systemd hardening: specifier escaping (\\`%\\` → \\`%%\\`) + newline rejection instead of (incorrect) quoting — verified against systemd's parser behavior.\n\n**Verification:** 2,507 tests green (+76 this branch), race-checked concurrency subset, gofmt/vet/lint clean. Live smoke on darwin with a sandboxed daemon dir (\\`ENTIRE_BRAIN_DAEMON_DIR\\`): real launchctl load/verify/uninstall with test-unique labels, real \\`~/Library/LaunchAgents\\` untouched throughout. Mutation-verified: daemon budget semantics (6 gated runs across 3 windows x 2 repos, not 1), distill lock (exactly one spender), workspace lock, repo-independent units.\" 2>&1 | tail -1","description":"Push onboarding branch and open PR"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_read_input_tokens":537702,"output_tokens":1560,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":237},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1560,"cache_read_input_tokens":537702,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2740,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2740},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCcCmJqY3saoQoqfJU8o","type":"assistant","uuid":"962e9d61-86f5-4c6c-a173-5739aec05d20","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:49:34.704Z","effort":"xhigh","