{"parentUuid":"053060f2-8232-408c-ad0f-df984a545a77","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCcsEVX4tNzXs1LDycDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":545250,"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":136},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":595,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":545250,"cache_creation_input_tokens":595,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":595},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCcs81bKaBTMHHEz9rkt","type":"assistant","uuid":"206fa25e-f991-4780-b801-cfe83479d723","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:58:16.054Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"206fa25e-f991-4780-b801-cfe83479d723","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCcsEVX4tNzXs1LDycDu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Working. Here's your playground — everything sandboxed under `~/brain-demo`, your real brain and LaunchAgents untouched:\n\n```bash\n# 1. Enter the sandbox (run in every new terminal you use for this)\nsource ~/brain-demo/env.sh\ncd ~/brain-demo/repo\n\n# 2. The one-command onboarding (the whole feature)\nentire-brain setup\n\n# 3. See the onboarding view: facts N/M distilled, daemon health, component freshness\nentire-brain status\n\n# 4. Prove idempotence — run it again, watch everything say \"already\"\nentire-brain setup\n\n# 5. The brain is queryable immediately after the instant phase\nentire-brain brief \"how do refunds work in this repo\"\nentire-brain search ChargeCard\n\n# 6. Daemon inspection (it's a real launchd job, sandboxed label + sandboxed plist dir)\nlaunchctl list | grep entire\n\n# 7. Clean up the daemon when done playing\nentire-brain setup --uninstall-daemon\n```\n\nVariations worth trying: `entire-brain setup --no-daemon` (skip the daemon), `entire-brain setup --backfill-budget 5` (see the spend cap disclosure), `entire-brain setup --help` (the full flag surface).\n\nTwo honest notes: the demo repo has **no captured agent sessions**, so backfill will say \"no captured sessions yet — it will start once sessions land\" and the facts counter reads 0/0 (that's correct behavior; real repos with session history show the N/M counter climbing). And the semantic step may show `missing` here because the sandbox repo has no remote — a pre-existing quirk unrelated to setup. To wipe the whole playground: `rm -rf ~/brain-demo` (after the uninstall in step 7)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":595,"cache_read_input_tokens":545250,"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":136},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":595,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":545250,"cache_creation_input_tokens":595,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":595},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCcs81bKaBTMHHEz9rkt","type":"assistant","uuid":"892735f9-8e07-4fad-ab4e-455bff730ad2","timestamp":"2026-08-19T18:58:16.179Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
