{"parentUuid":"1b16d7b2-1942-4cfb-a68e-be62e3f2c1d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCdAF1kGLndC53EXDfno","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01CBMSbSSRuAfCKqVYpvFoxr","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Fix setup hard-fail UX","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"opus","prompt":"Targeted UX fix in /Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/brain-onboarding (entire-brain, branch feat/brain-setup-onboarding, pushed as PR #89). Use rtk. Reproduced defect: on a local repo with no git remote, the instant phase's semantic step fails with `semantic snapshot repo_key \"local/repo\" does not match current repo \"local/repo-<hash>\"` (a pre-existing key-derivation skew between the installed entire CLI and the brain), and `runSetup` ABORTS the entire onboarding — no workspace, no daemon, no status. First-run UX dies on a component failure.\n\nFIX (setup.go, the instant phase in runSetup):\n1. Make the instant phase per-component best-effort: a failing component (semantic, docs, seed, etc.) is reported as one clear line — `setup: semantic index failed (repo key mismatch: ...) — continuing; run 'entire-brain doctor' for detail` — and the remaining components + later phases (backfill, workspace, daemon) still run. The phase summary line must say what built and what failed.\n2. Hard-fail ONLY when nothing usable exists at the end (brain dir unwritable / every component failed) — then exit non-zero with the collected reasons.\n3. Exit code: 0 when the brain is queryable (core components built) even with a degraded component; document the rule in the command help.\n4. For THIS specific known skew, detect the repo_key-mismatch error string and append the actionable hint: \"this repo has no git remote; add one (git remote add origin ...) or upgrade the entire CLI so both derive the same key\".\n5. `entire-brain status` onboarding section must show the failed component as `semantic=failed` (not just missing) with the reason available via doctor.\n\nTests: fake runner making the semantic step fail → setup completes, workspace registered, daemon planned, exit 0, output contains the failure line + hint; all-components-fail → non-zero. MUTATION: revert to abort-on-first-failure → the degraded-continue test fails. Full `go test ./...` green, gofmt/vet clean. Amend/append commit (no AI footers) and PUSH to the existing branch (updates PR #89).\nReport caveman-ultra: change summary w/ file:line, test names, mutation result, suite tally, pushed sha. Max 12 lines."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2109,"cache_read_input_tokens":563937,"output_tokens":1408,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":182},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2109,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1408,"cache_read_input_tokens":563937,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2109,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2109},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CeCdA9SdqCJsytSRBC9je","type":"assistant","uuid":"ea325552-9981-44b4-ba5b-191e61c0b5ec","timestamp":"2026-08-19T19:02:04.678Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.236","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
