{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-19T19:24:50.993Z","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>adcb04964cdf2d3a0</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01CBMSbSSRuAfCKqVYpvFoxr</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af/tasks/adcb04964cdf2d3a0.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Fix setup hard-fail UX\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>Done. PR #89 updated.\n\n**Change** — instant phase is now per-component best-effort:\n- `refresh.go:34-40` new `refreshCommandOptions.component` callback; `refresh.go:145-154` `stage()` helper; every stage (`sessions`/`seed`/`docs`/`semantic`/`history`/`history-vectors`/`branches`/`facts`/`patterns`) reports its outcome and no longer aborts in best-effort mode.\n- `watch.go:479-497` `watchDeterministicRefreshComponents` (old `watchDeterministicRefresh` delegates, strict behaviour unchanged for watch/workspace).\n- `setup.go:68-215` component type, labels, repo-key-mismatch detection + hint, summary/failure-line/reason helpers; `setup.go:~430` `steps.instant` now returns `([]setupComponent, error)`; instant phase prints one line per degraded component, hard-fails only when the phase errored or every attempted component failed; help documents the exit rule; `printSetupSummary` gained the instant line; `instant.json` record persisted.\n- `setup_status.go:157-220` `instantPhaseComponents` layers the record: `semantic=failed` (not `missing`), wins over a stale-present source, self-heals when the source is regenerated after the record. `doctor.go:75-90` prints the reason + hint.\n\n**Live repro (temp repo, no remote, isolated plugin dirs)**: `setup: semantic index failed (repo key mismatch: ... \"local/repo\" vs \"local/repo-768f5c0748c2\") — continuing; run 'entire-brain doctor' for detail` + hint; `built sessions, seed, docs, patterns, memory; FAILED semantic`; workspace registered; **EXIT=0**. `status` → `semantic=failed`; `doctor` → full reason + hint.\n\n**Tests**: `TestSetupContinuesWhenTheSemanticComponentFails` (real instant path over fake runner), `TestSetupFailsWhenEveryInstantComponentFails`, `TestSetupIsStillDegradedNotFailedWithASingleSurvivor`, `TestInstantPhaseComponentsSeparateFailedFromMissing`.\n\n**Mutation**: reverting `stage()` to abort-on-first-failure → `TestSetupContinuesWhenTheSemanticComponentFails` FAILS (`setup: instant core ... failed`). Restored, re-verified green.\n\n**Suite**: 2510 passed, 9 skipped, 1 failed — `TestBuildBrainOnboardingStatusReportsBackfillAndDaemon`, **pre-existing and environmental** (verified failing on the stashed pre-change tree: this machine has a real `io.entire.brain-watch` launchd unit the fixture's temp HOME doesn't hide). gofmt -s, go vet clean.\n\n**Pushed**: `73e2073da3b8c4fdaa6149be26a0cbb0f02c23e8` → `feat/brain-setup-onboarding` (PR #89, open).</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>180762</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>98</tool_uses><duration_ms>1361056</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
