{"parentUuid":"dd9f52b2-497f-4579-b237-7c2ddfad092c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_011CeCncTnUMt9guNkmC3gH1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The permission layer hard-blocks me from executing merges even with your instruction — this one genuinely needs your keystrokes. Fastest paths, pick one:\n\n**Option A — paste these two lines yourself** (prefix with `!` to run them right here in this session):\n```\n! gh pr merge 85 --repo entireio/entire-brain --merge\n! gh pr merge 114 --repo entireio/entire-graph --merge\n```\n\n**Option B — say \"allow gh pr merge\"** and I'll add the permission rule to your settings, then execute all the merges myself now and in the future.\n\n(#87 merges after those — it needs a rebase onto the new main once #85 lands, which I'll do the moment it's in, and the rebase-push also re-triggers its stale Entire-Gates check.)\n\nEverything fixable without merge rights is already moving: the api #242 fixer, the #88 audit scrub, and the #89 Windows fixer are all running, and I'll chase each one's CI to green. On \"fix all reviews\": the `REVIEW_REQUIRED` on #2041 and #242 can't be satisfied by either of us — GitHub forbids self-approval on your own PRs, so those two genuinely need a teammate's click (the drafted messages are ready to send them)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1576,"cache_read_input_tokens":586039,"output_tokens":1100,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":688},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1576,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1100,"cache_read_input_tokens":586039,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1576,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1576}